INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: How do you reuse information across service worker restarts

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
The problem with service worker is that it gets terminated when not in use, and restarted when it''s next needed, so you cannot rely on global state within a service worker''s `onfetch` and `onmessage` handlers. In this case, service workers will have access to IndexedDB API in order to persist and reuse across restarts.

    **[⬆ Back to Top](#table-of-contents)**

