INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: What is the purpose of exec method

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
The purpose of exec method is similar to test method but it executes a search for a match in a specified string and returns a result array, or null instead of returning true/false.

      ```javascript
      var pattern = /you/;
