INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: How do you make synchronous HTTP request

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
Browsers provide an XMLHttpRequest object which can be used to make synchronous HTTP requests from JavaScript.

      ```javascript
      function httpGet(theUrl) {
        var xmlHttpReq = new XMLHttpRequest();
        xmlHttpReq.open("GET", theUrl, false); // false for synchronous request
        xmlHttpReq.send(null);
        return xmlHttpReq.responseText;
      }
      ```

