INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: Why do I need to use the freeze method

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
In the Object-oriented paradigm, an existing API contains certain elements that are not intended to be extended, modified, or re-used outside of their current context. Hence it works as the `final` keyword which is used in various languages.

      **[⬆ Back to Top](#table-of-contents)**

