VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: What is the precedence order between local and global variables

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
A local variable takes precedence over a global variable with the same name. Let''s see this behavior in an example.

      ```javascript
      var msg = "Good morning";
      function greeting() {
        msg = "Good Evening";
        console.log(msg); // Good Evening
      }
      greeting();
      ```

