INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: What are javascript accessors

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
ECMAScript 5 introduced javascript object accessors or computed properties through getters and setters. Getters uses the `get` keyword whereas Setters uses the `set` keyword.

      ```javascript
      var user = {
        firstName: "John",
        lastName: "Abraham",
        language: "en",
        get lang() {
          return this.language;
        },
        set lang(lang) {
          this.language = lang;
        },
      };
      console.log(user.lang); // getter access lang as en
      user.lang = "fr";
      console.log(user.lang); // setter used to set lang as fr
      ```

      **[⬆ Back to Top](#table-of-contents)**

