INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: What are the differences between javascript and typescript

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
Below are the list of differences between javascript and typescript,

      | feature             | typescript                            | javascript                                      |
      | ------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
      | Language paradigm   | Object oriented programming language  | Multi-paradigm language                         |
      | Typing support      | Supports static typing                | Dynamic typing                                  |
      | Modules             | Supported                             | Not supported                                   |
      | Interface           | It has interfaces concept             | Doesn''t support interfaces                      |
      | Optional parameters | Functions support optional parameters | No support of optional parameters for functions |

      **[⬆ Back to Top](#table-of-contents)**

