VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: Give an example usage of the rangeOverflow property

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
If an element''s value is greater than its max attribute then the `rangeOverflow` property is true. For example, the below form submission throws an error if the value is more than 100,

