INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: How do you get unique values of an array

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
You can get unique values of an array with the combination of `Set` and rest expression/spread(...) syntax.

      ```javascript
      console.log([...new Set([1, 2, 4, 4, 3])]); // [1, 2, 4, 3]
