INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: How do you flattening multi dimensional arrays

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
Flattening bi-dimensional arrays is trivial with Spread operator.

      ```javascript
      const biDimensionalArr = [11, [22, 33], [44, 55], [66, 77], 88, 99];
      const flattenArr = [].concat(...biDimensionalArr); // [11, 22, 33, 44, 55, 66, 77, 88, 99]
      ```

      But you can make it work with multi-dimensional arrays by recursive calls,

      ```javascript
      function flattenMultiArray(arr) {
        const flattened = [].concat(...arr);
        return flattened.some((item) => Array.isArray(item))
          ? flattenMultiArray(flattened)
          : flattened;
      }
      const multiDimensionalArr = [
        11,
        [22, 33],
        [44, [55, 66, [77, [88]], 99]],
      ];
      const flatArr = flattenMultiArray(multiDimensionalArr); // [11, 22, 33, 44, 55, 66, 77, 88, 99]
      ```

      Also you can use the `flat` method of Array.

      ```javascript
      const arr = [1, [2, 3], 4, 5, [6, 7]];
      const fllattenArr = arr.flat(); // [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]

      // And for multiDimensional arrays
      const multiDimensionalArr = [
        11,
        [22, 33],
        [44, [55, 66, [77, [88]], 99]],
      ];
      const oneStepFlat = multiDimensionalArr.flat(1); // [11, 22, 33, 44, [55, 66, [77, [88]], 99]]
      const towStep = multiDimensionalArr.flat(2); // [11, 22, 33, 44, 55, 66, [77, [88]], 99]
      const fullyFlatArray = multiDimensionalArr.flat(Infinity); // [11, 22, 33, 44, 55, 66, 77, 88, 99]
      ```

      **[⬆ Back to Top](#table-of-contents)**

381.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript Core & DOM", "subtopic": "How do you flattening multi dimensional arrays", "category": "Theory", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sudheerj/javascript-interview-questions/master/README.md", "dataset_type": "Real-World-Curated-Online"}'::jsonb)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
