VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: # 56. What is the output of below code?

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: JavaScript Core & DOM | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
```javascript
let count = 10;

(function innerFunc() {
  if (count === 10) {
    let count = 11;
    console.log(count);
  }
  console.log(count);
})();
```

- 1: 11, 10
- 2: 11, 11
- 3: 10, 11
- 4: 10, 10

<details><summary><b>Answer</b></summary>
<p>', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript Core & DOM", "subtopic": "# 56. What is the output of below code?", "category": "Theory", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sudheerj/javascript-interview-questions/master/README.md", "dataset_type": "Real-World-Curated-Online"}'::jsonb)
