INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: Why can''t you update props in React?

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
The React philosophy is that props should be _immutable_(read only) and _top-down_. This means that a parent can send any prop values to a child, but the child can''t modify received props.

**[⬆ Back to Top](#table-of-contents)**

