INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: How do you apply vendor prefixes to inline styles in React?

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
React _does not_ apply _vendor prefixes_ automatically. You need to add vendor prefixes manually.

    ```jsx harmony
    <div
      style={{
        transform: "rotate(90deg)",
        WebkitTransform: "rotate(90deg)", // note the capital ''W'' here
        msTransform: "rotate(90deg)", // ''ms'' is the only lowercase vendor prefix
      }}
    />
    ```

