VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: Can you combine **useReducer** with **useContext**?

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
Yes, it''s common to combine **useReducer** with **useContext** to build a lightweight state management system similar to Redux:

      ```js
      const AppContext = React.createContext();

      function AppProvider({ children }) {
        const [state, dispatch] = useReducer(reducer, initialState);
        return (
          <AppContext.Provider value={{ state, dispatch }}>
            {children}
          </AppContext.Provider>
        );
      }
      ```

