VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: How do reactive dependencies in the useEffect dependency array affect its execution behavior?

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
The `useEffect` hook accepts an optional dependencies argument that accepts an array of reactive values. The **dependency array** determines **when** the effect runs. i.e, It makes `useEffect` _reactive_ to changes in specified values.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "React & Hooks", "subtopic": "How do reactive dependencies in the useEffect dependency array affect its execution behavior?", "category": "Theory", "difficulty": "Easy", "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sudheerj/reactjs-interview-questions/master/README.md", "dataset_type": "Real-World-Curated-Online"}'::jsonb)
