INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: # Example: Dynamic Style Injection

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
```jsx
     import { useInsertionEffect } from ''react'';

     let isInserted = new Set();

     function useCSS(rule) {
       useInsertionEffect(() => {
         if (!isInserted.has(rule)) {
           isInserted.add(rule);
           const style = document.createElement(''style'');
           style.textContent = rule;
           document.head.appendChild(style);
         }
       }, [rule]);
     }

     function Button() {
       useCSS(''.dynamic-btn { background: blue; color: white; }'');
       return <button className="dynamic-btn">Click me</button>;
     }
     ```

     **Note:** This hook is not intended for application code. It''s specifically for CSS-in-JS libraries like styled-components or Emotion to prevent style flickering.

