INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: # 6. **Avoid Inline Object/Function Dependencies**

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
```jsx
     // ❌ Bad: New object on every render
     useEffect(() => {
       doSomething(options);
     }, [{ page: 1, limit: 10 }]); // Always different reference

     // ✅ Good: Memoize or extract
