INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: # Streaming SSR (React 18+)

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
```
     Server: Send HTML as it''s ready, wrap slow parts in <Suspense>
     Client: Render immediately, hydrate progressively
     Benefit: User sees content faster!
