INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: What are forward refs?

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
_Ref forwarding_ is a feature that lets some components take a _ref_ they receive, and pass it further down to a child.

   ```jsx harmony
   const ButtonElement = React.forwardRef((props, ref) => (
     <button ref={ref} className="CustomButton">
       {props.children}
     </button>
   ));

   // Create ref to the DOM button:
   const ref = React.createRef();
   <ButtonElement ref={ref}>{"Forward Ref"}</ButtonElement>;
   ```

   **[⬆ Back to Top](#table-of-contents)**

