INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: What would be the common mistake of function being called every time the component renders?

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
You need to make sure that function is not being called while passing the function as a parameter.

    ```jsx harmony
    render() {
      // Wrong: handleClick is called instead of passed as a reference!
      return <button onClick={this.handleClick()}>{''Click Me''}</button>
    }
    ```

    Instead, pass the function itself without parenthesis:

    ```jsx harmony
    render() {
      // Correct: handleClick is passed as a reference!
      return <button onClick={this.handleClick}>{''Click Me''}</button>
    }
    ```

    **[⬆ Back to Top](#table-of-contents)**

