INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: Is it possible to use React without rendering HTML?

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Topic**: React & Hooks | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
It is possible. Below are the possible options:

    ```jsx harmony
    render() {
      return false
    }
    ```

    ```jsx harmony
    render() {
      return true
    }
