    ```jsx harmony
    render() {
      return <React.Fragment></React.Fragment>
    }
    ```

    ```jsx harmony
    render() {
      return <></>
    }
    ```

    React version >=18.0.0:

    ```jsx harmony
    render() {
      return undefined
    }
    ```

