INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: Networking

**Role**: DevOps / Cloud Engineer | **Topic**: Linux System Administration | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
<details>
<summary>How to list all the interfaces?</summary><br><b>

```
ip link show
```
</b></details>

