Learn more [here](https://aws.amazon.com/documentdb)
</b></details>

<details>
<summary>What "AWS Database Migration Service" is used for?</summary><br><b>
</b></details>

<details>
<summary>What type of storage is used by Amazon RDS?</summary><br><b>

EBS
</b></details>', '{"role": "DevOps / Cloud Engineer", "role_id": "devops_cloud_engineer", "topic": "Cloud Computing & AWS", "subtopic": "# RedShift", "category": "Theory", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bregman-arie/devops-exercises/master/topics/aws/README.md", "dataset_type": "Real-World-Curated-Online"}'::jsonb)
