INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Technical Interview Question: Step 2: Create a high level design

**Role**: Backend Developer | **Topic**: Server Architecture & Scaling | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
