#### Technical Explanation & Model Answer
There are two complementary patterns to support high availability: **fail-over** and **replication**.', '{"role": "Backend Developer", "role_id": "backend_developer", "topic": "Server Architecture & Scaling", "subtopic": "Availability patterns", "category": "Theory", "difficulty": "Easy", "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/donnemartin/system-design-primer/master/README.md", "dataset_type": "Real-World-Curated-Online"}'::jsonb)
