Write a function to generate the nth Fibonacci number.
**Input Specification**:
```
< noinput >
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def fib(n):
    if n == 0:
        return 0
    elif n == 1:
        return 1
    else:
        return fib(n-2) + fib(n-1)
```

