INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Design a program to find the longest element in the given list.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Design a program to find the longest element in the given list.
**Input Specification**:
```
[10, 100, 200, 500, 400]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def longest_element(list):
  max_length = 0
  max_length_item = None

  for item in list:
    if len(item) > max_length:
      max_length = len(item)
      max_length_item = item

  return max_length_item

list = [10, 100, 200, 500, 400]
longest_element(list) # 500
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Design a program to find the longest element in the given list.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
