INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a program that ciphers a given text using the caesar cipher.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a program that ciphers a given text using the caesar cipher.
**Input Specification**:
```
text = "This is a secret message"
key = 3
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def caesar_cipher(text, key):
    """Cipher a given text using the Caesar Cipher."""
    ciphertext = ""
    for char in text: 
        if not char.isalpha():
            ciphertext += char
            continue
        offset = ord(''a'') if char.islower() else ord(''A'')
        new_char = (ord(char) - offset + key) % 26
        ciphertext += chr(offset + new_char)
    return ciphertext
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a program that ciphers a given text using the caesar cipher.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
