Write a Python program to generate the first n Fibonacci numbers.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def generate_fibonacci_numbers(n):
   if n==1:
       return [0]
   elif n==2:
       return [0,1]
   else:
       fib_list = [0,1]
       for i in range(2,n):
           fib_list.append(fib_list[i-1]+fib_list[i-2])
       return fib_list
```

