INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a JavaScript program which takes an array of integers as a parameter and reverses the array in-place.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a JavaScript program which takes an array of integers as a parameter and reverses the array in-place.
**Input Specification**:
```
[3, 5, 9, 1, 6]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function reverseArrayInPlace(nums) {
    let left = 0;
    let right = nums.length - 1;
  
    while (left < right) {
        let temp = nums[left];
        nums[left] = nums[right];
        nums[right] = temp;
  
        left++;
        right--;
    }
    return nums;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Create a JavaScript program which takes an array of integers as a parameter and ", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
