VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a JavaScript function to capitalize the first letter of each word in a string.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Write a JavaScript function to capitalize the first letter of each word in a string.
**Input Specification**:
```
String: "This is an example".
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function capitalizeFirstLetter(str) {
    return str.replace(/\w\S*/g, function(txt) {
        return txt.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + txt.substr(1).toLowerCase();
    });
}
capitalizeFirstLetter(''This is an example'');
```

