INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function in Java that takes two strings as parameters and returns true if the first string is a substring of the second.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a function in Java that takes two strings as parameters and returns true if the first string is a substring of the second.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public boolean isSubstring(String s1, String s2) 
{ 
    int M = s1.length(); 
    int N = s2.length(); 
  
    for (int i = 0; i <= N - M; i++) { 
        int j; 
  
        for (j = 0; j < M; j++) 
            if (s2.charAt(i + j) != s1.charAt(j)) 
                break; 
  
        if (j == M) 
            return true; 
    } 
  
    return false; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Write a function in Java that takes two strings as parameters and returns true i", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
