VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a Java program to print out the first n prime numbers

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a Java program to print out the first n prime numbers

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static void printPrimeNumbers(int n) 
    { 
        int num; 
        int count=0;
        for (int i = 2; i <= n;) 
        { 
            num=0; 
            for (int j = 2; j <= i / 2; j++)  
            { 
                if (i % j == 0) 
                { 
                    num++; 
                    break; 
                } 
            } 
            if (num == 0) 
            { 
                System.out.print(i+" "); 
                count++; 
            } 
            i++; 
        } 
    }
```

