VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write C++ code to find the maximum subarray sum

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write C++ code to find the maximum subarray sum

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
int maxSubarraySum(int arr[], int n) { 
    int max_so_far = 0, max_ending_here = 0; 
  
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { 
        max_ending_here = max_ending_here + arr[i]; 
        if (max_so_far < max_ending_here) 
            max_so_far = max_ending_here; 
  
        if (max_ending_here < 0) 
            max_ending_here = 0; 
    } 
    return max_so_far; 
}
```

