VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a JavaScript function that takes an array of numbers and returns the median value from the array.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Create a JavaScript function that takes an array of numbers and returns the median value from the array.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function getMedian(arr) {
  arr.sort(function (a, b) {
    return a - b;
  });
  
  let mid = Math.floor(arr.length / 2);
  
  if (arr.length % 2 === 0) {
    return (arr[mid - 1] + arr[mid]) / 2;
  } else {
    return arr[mid];
  }
}
```

