INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write code in Java to create a linked list.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write code in Java to create a linked list.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
class Node{
    int data; 
    Node next; 
        
    Node(int d){
        data = d; 
        next = null; 
    } 
} 

class LinkedList{ 
    Node head; 
        
    public void insert(int data){ 
        Node node = new Node(data); 
        if (head == null) { 
            head = node; 
        } 
        else { 
            Node n = head; 
            while (n.next != null) { 
                n = n.next; 
            } 
            n.next = node; 
        } 
    } 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Write code in Java to create a linked list.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
