INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Construct a Java program for sorting a given array in ascending order.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Construct a Java program for sorting a given array in ascending order.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class ArraySort { 
    public static int[] sortArray(int[] arr) { 
        int n = arr.length; 
        for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) { 
            int min_idx = i; 
            for (int j = i + 1; j < n; j++) 
                if (arr[j] < arr[min_idx]) 
                    min_idx = j; 
            int temp = arr[min_idx]; 
            arr[min_idx] = arr[i]; 
            arr[i] = temp; 
        } 
        return arr; 
    } 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Construct a Java program for sorting a given array in ascending order.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
