#### Problem Description
Create a C++ code to find the average of n numbers.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <iostream> 
using namespace std; 
  
float avg(int n, int arr[]) 
{  
    float sum, avg; 
  
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) 
    {
        sum = sum + arr[i]; 
    }
    avg = sum / n; 
    return avg; 
}
```

