INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a Java program to check for a palindrome.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a Java program to check for a palindrome.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class Palindrome {  
    public static boolean isPalindrome(String str){ 
        // Pointers pointing to the beginning 
        // and the end of the string 
        int i = 0, j = str.length() - 1; 
  
        // While there are characters toc compare 
        while (i < j) { 
  
            // If there is a mismatch 
            if (str.charAt(i) != str.charAt(j)) 
                return false; 
  
            // Increment first pointer and 
            // decrement the other 
            i++; 
            j--; 
        } 
  
        // Given string is a palindrome 
        return true; 
    } 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a Java program to check for a palindrome.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
