INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Given an array of integers, write an algorithm to find the first repeating element.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Given an array of integers, write an algorithm to find the first repeating element.
**Input Specification**:
```
[2, 5, 1, 2, 3, 5]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
int findFirstRepeating(int arr[], int n) 
{ 
    unordered_set<int> s; 
  
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { 
        if (s.find(arr[i]) != s.end()) 
            return arr[i];         
        s.insert(arr[i]); 
    }  
  
    return -1; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Given an array of integers, write an algorithm to find the first repeating eleme", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Easy", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
