INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a code to find the maximum subarray sum in an array using dynamic programming.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a code to find the maximum subarray sum in an array using dynamic programming.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def maxSubArraySum(arr): 
    n = len(arr) 
  
    max_so_far = -float(''inf'') 
    max_ending_here = 0
  
    for i in range(0, n): 
        max_ending_here = max_ending_here + arr[i] 
        if (max_so_far < max_ending_here): 
            max_so_far = max_ending_here 
  
        if max_ending_here < 0: 
            max_ending_here = 0   
    return max_so_far
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Write a code to find the maximum subarray sum in an array using dynamic programm", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
