INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create an algorithm to sort a list of numbers in ascending order.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create an algorithm to sort a list of numbers in ascending order.
**Input Specification**:
```
lst = [2, 5, 1, 7, 4]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def sort_list_ascending(lst):
    # Traverse through all array elements 
    for i in range(len(lst)): 
  
        # Find the minimum element in remaining  
        # unsorted array 
        min_idx = i 
        for j in range(i+1, len(lst)): 
            if lst[min_idx] > lst[j]: 
                min_idx = j 
          
        # Swap the found minimum element with  
        # the first element         
        lst[i], lst[min_idx] = lst[min_idx], lst[i] 
  
    return lst
  
# Driver code to test above 
lst = [2, 5, 1, 7, 4] 
print(sort_list_ascending(lst))
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create an algorithm to sort a list of numbers in ascending order.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
