VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Find the power of a number using an iterative approach in Java.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Find the power of a number using an iterative approach in Java.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static int power(int base, int exp) 
{ 
    int result = 1; 
    while (exp != 0) 
    { 
        result *= base; 
        --exp; 
    } 
    return result; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
