VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Edit the above PHP function so that it also checks if a given number is prime.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Edit the above PHP function so that it also checks if a given number is prime.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function isPrime($n) {
  if ($n == 1) {
    return false;
  } 
  elseif ($n == 2) {
    return true;
  } 
  else {
    for ($i = 2; $i <= sqrt($n); $i++) {
      if ($n % $i == 0) {
        return false;
        break;
      }
    }
    return true;
  }
}
```

