INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Design a program to compare two sorted lists and returning list with the common elements.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Design a program to compare two sorted lists and returning list with the common elements.
**Input Specification**:
```
list_one=[5, 10, 15, 20, 25]
list_two=[15, 17, 20, 22, 25, 27]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def compare_list(list_one, list_two):
    common_list = []
    i, j = 0, 0
    while (i < len(list_one) and j < len(list_two)):
        if list_one[i] == list_two[j]:
            common_list.append(list_one[i])
            i += 1
            j += 1
        elif list_one[i] < list_two[j]:
            i += 1
        else:
            j += 1
    return common_list
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Design a program to compare two sorted lists and returning list with the common ", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
