VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a method to print all the prime numbers up to n.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a method to print all the prime numbers up to n.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def print_prime_numbers(n):
    primes = [] 
    for num in range(2, n + 1): 
        is_prime = True
        for i in range(2, num): 
            if (num % i == 0): 
                is_prime = False
                break
        if is_prime: 
            primes.append(num) 
    print(primes)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
