VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement a reverse method to reverse the content of an array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement a reverse method to reverse the content of an array.
**Input Specification**:
```
[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def reverse(arr): 
    n =len(arr) 
    for i in range(n // 2): 
        temp = arr[i] 
        arr[i] = arr[n - i - 1] 
        arr[n - i - 1] = temp
  
    return arr
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
