INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a method to reverse a linked list.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a method to reverse a linked list.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def reverse_list(head): 
  
    prev = None
    current = head 
    while(current is not None): 
        next = current.next
        current.next = prev 
        prev = current 
        current = next
    head = prev 
    return head
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a method to reverse a linked list.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
