INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function to collect all the alphabets from a given string.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a function to collect all the alphabets from a given string.
**Input Specification**:
```
The string is "My name is John!"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
//Function to collect all the alphabets
function getAlphabets(str) {
  const result = [];
  for(let i=0; i < str.length; i++) {
    if(str[i].match(/[a-z]/i)) {
      result.push(str[i]);
    }
  }
  return result;
}

//Call function and pass the string as parameter
let alphabets = getAlphabets("My name is John!"); 
console.log(alphabets); // Output: ["M", "y", "n", "a", "m", "e", "i", "s", "J", "o", "h"]
```

