Create a Python program to generate the Fibonacci series between 0 and 10.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def FibonacciSequence():
  a, b = 0, 1
  for _ in range(10):
    yield a
    a, b = b, a + b

for num in FibonacciSequence():
  print(num)
```

