VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a Java class that prints the Fibonacci sequence between 0 and 10.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a Java class that prints the Fibonacci sequence between 0 and 10.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class Fibonacci {

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    printFibonacci();
  }

  public static void printFibonacci() {
    int n1 = 0;
