VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create an integer array using Java and sort it using the bubble sort algorithm.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create an integer array using Java and sort it using the bubble sort algorithm.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
// Create an integer array
int[] array = {4, 2, 6, 1, 3};

// Sort the array using the bubbleSort function
bubbleSort(array);

// Write a function to implement the bubbleSort algorithm
public static int[] bubbleSort(int[] array) {
    int len = array.length;
    for (int i = 0; i < len; i++) {
        for (int j = 0; j < len; j++) {
            if (array[j] > array[j+1]) {
                int temp = array[j];
                array[j] = array[j+1];
                array[j+1] = temp;
            }
        }
    }
    return array;
}
// The sorted array is [1, 2, 3, 4, 6]
```

