**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Write a JavaScript function for reversing a string.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function reverseString(str) {
    let revStr = '''';
    for(let i = str.length-1; i >= 0; i--) {
        revStr += str[i];
    }
    return revStr;
}
