INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a C++ program to print all prime numbers between 1 and 100.

**Role**: Data Analyst | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a C++ program to print all prime numbers between 1 and 100.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include<iostream>  
using namespace std;  
int main()  
{  
 int i, j,flag;   
 for (i = 2; i <= 100; i++)  
 {  
     flag = 0;  
     for (j = 2; j <= i / 2; j++)  
     {  
         if (i % j == 0)
         {  
             flag = 1;  
             break;  
         }  
     }  
     if (flag == 0)  
         cout << i << " ";  
 }  
 return 0;  
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
