- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Data Analyst", "role_id": "data_analyst", "topic": "Data Analytics & SQL Queries", "subtopic": "Write a C++ program to print all prime numbers between 1 and 100.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
