VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a C++ algorithm to compute the Fibonacci sequence.

**Role**: Backend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a C++ algorithm to compute the Fibonacci sequence.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <iostream> 

int fibonacci(int n) { 
    if (n <= 1) 
        return n; 
    return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2); 
} 
  
int main() { 
    int n = 10; 
    std::cout << "The Fibonacci number at position " << n << " is " << fibonacci(n); 
    return 0; 
}
```

