```
list = [1, 3, 7, -2, 4]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def minmax(list)
    min = list[0]
    max = list[0]
    for num in list[1:]:
        if num < min:
            min = num
        if num > max:
            max = num

    return min, max
