INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Generate a code snippet to find the highest common factor of two given numbers

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Generate a code snippet to find the highest common factor of two given numbers

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function highestCommonFactor(m, n) {
  if (m === 0 || n === 0) {
      return 0;
  }

  let a = Math.max(m, n);
  let b = Math.min(m, n);

  while (b !== 0) {
      let c = b;
      b = a % b;
      a = c;
  }

  return a;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Generate a code snippet to find the highest common factor of two given numbers", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Easy", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
