INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement the following algorithm in Java.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Implement the following algorithm in Java.
**Input Specification**:
```
// Bubble sort algorithm 
for i in 0 to n-1 
  for j in 0 to n-i-1 
    if array[j] > array[j+1] 
      swap array[j] and array[j+1]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public void bubbleSort(int[] arr){
  for (int i = 0; i < arr.length - 1; i++) {
    for (int j = 0; j < arr.length - i - 1; j++) {
      if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {
        int temp = arr[j];
        arr[j] = arr[j + 1];
        arr[j + 1] = temp;
      }
    }
  }
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Implement the following algorithm in Java.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
