INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function to calculate the Levenshtein distance between two strings

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a function to calculate the Levenshtein distance between two strings
**Input Specification**:
```
str1 = "geeks", str2 = "geek"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def lev_dist(str1, str2):
    if len(str1) < len(str2):
        return lev_dist(str2, str1)
    
    if len(str2) == 0:
        return len(str1)
 
    previous_row = range(len(str2) + 1)
    for i, c1 in enumerate(str1):
        current_row = [i + 1]
        for j, c2 in enumerate(str2):
            insertions = previous_row[j + 1] + 1
            deletions = current_row[j] + 1
            substitutions = previous_row[j] + (c1 != c2)
            current_row.append(min(insertions, deletions, substitutions))
        previous_row = current_row
    
    return previous_row[-1]
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a function to calculate the Levenshtein distance between two strings", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
