INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function to compute the square root of a given number

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a function to compute the square root of a given number
**Input Specification**:
```
9
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def sqrt(n):
    """
    Compute the square root of a given number
    """
    r = n
    while r*r > n:
        r = (r + n/r) // 2
    return r

n = 9
val = sqrt(n)
print(val)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a function to compute the square root of a given number", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
