INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Complete the following code to implement a binary search.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Complete the following code to implement a binary search.
**Input Specification**:
```
def binary_search(arr, x):
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def binary_search(arr, x):
    left = 0
    right = len(arr) - 1
    
    while left <= right:
        mid = (left + right) // 2
        if arr[mid] == x:
            return mid
        elif arr[mid] < x:
            left = mid + 1
        else:
            right = mid - 1
    return -1
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Complete the following code to implement a binary search.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
