INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a PHP program to count the number of occurrences of a given word in a string.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a PHP program to count the number of occurrences of a given word in a string.
**Input Specification**:
```
Test string, word
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
<?php

function count_occurrences($string, $word) {
    $words = explode(" ", $string);
    $count = 0;
    foreach ($words as $w)
        if (strtolower($w) == strtolower($word))
            $count++;
    return $count;
}

$string = "Test string";
$word = "string";

echo count_occurrences($string, $word);

?>
// Output: 1
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
