```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def fibonacci(n): 
    if n < 0: 
        print("Incorrect input") 
    elif n == 0: 
        return 0
    elif n == 1: 
        return 1
    else: 
        return fibonacci(n-1) + fibonacci(n-2) 
  
fibonacci(15)
