INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create an algorithm to find the smallest positive integer not present in an array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create an algorithm to find the smallest positive integer not present in an array.
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [2, 3, 7, 6, 8, -1, -10, 15]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def find_missing(arr):
  # sort the array
  arr.sort()
  
  # iterate through the array 
  # to find the smallest positive integer not present 
  for i in range(len(arr)):
    if arr[i] > 0:
      if arr[i+1] != arr[i] + 1:
        return arr[i] + 1
  return arr[-1] + 1
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create an algorithm to find the smallest positive integer not present in an arra", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
