INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a JavaScript function to convert a number from octal to decimal.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a JavaScript function to convert a number from octal to decimal.
**Input Specification**:
```
octal_number = 014
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function octToDec(octal_number){
    let dec_number = 0;
    let i = 0;
    while(octal_number != 0){
        dec_number += (octal_number % 10) * Math.pow(8,i);
        octal_number = Math.floor(octal_number/10);
        i++;
    }
    return dec_number;
}
var decimal_number = octToDec(014);
console.log(decimal_number);
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Write a JavaScript function to convert a number from octal to decimal.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
