INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a program to calculate the standard deviation of an array of numbers.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a program to calculate the standard deviation of an array of numbers.
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [10, 8, 12, 5, 9]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def stdev(arr):
    n = len(arr)
    mean = sum(arr) / n
    variance = sum((x - mean) ** 2 for x in arr) / n
    return (variance ** 0.5)
```

