INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement a recursive binary search on a given sorted list.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement a recursive binary search on a given sorted list.
**Input Specification**:
```
[-4, -2, 0, 6, 7, 8]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def binary_search(arr, num, start, end): 
    if start >= end: 
        return None
  
    mid = start + (end - start)//2
    if arr[mid] == num: 
        return mid 
  
    if arr[mid] < num: 
        return binary_search(arr, num, mid+1, end) 
    else: 
        return binary_search(arr, num, start, mid-1)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Implement a recursive binary search on a given sorted list.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
