INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Generate code to parse the following HTML.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Generate code to parse the following HTML.
**Input Specification**:
```
<div>
    <h1>Heading</h1>
    <p>Content 1 </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Item 1</li>
      <li>Item 2</li>
    </ul>
</div>
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def parse_html(html):
    root = BeautifulSoup(html, ''html.parser'')
    heading = root.find(''h1'').text
    content1 = root.find(''p'').text
    items = [li.text for li in root.find_all(''li'')]
    return {
        ''heading'': heading,
        ''content1'': content1,
        ''items'': items
    }
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Generate code to parse the following HTML.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
