INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a Python program to add two matrices.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a Python program to add two matrices.
**Input Specification**:
```
matrix1 = [[3, 5],
           [6, 2]]

matrix2 = [[1, 2],
           [3, 4]]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def add_matrices(mat1, mat2):
    """
    This function takes two 2D matrices and adds them,
    returning a new 2D matrix.
    """
    output = []
    
    for i in range(len(mat1)):
        row_m1 = mat1[i]
        row_m2 = mat2[i]
        row_sum = []
        for j in range(len(row_m1)):
            row_sum.append(row_m1[j] + row_m2[j])
        output.append(row_sum)
        
    return output
    
result = add_matrices(matrix1, matrix2)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Write a Python program to add two matrices.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
