VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement an Insertion Sort algorithm in Java.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Implement an Insertion Sort algorithm in Java.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static void insertSort(int[] arr) {
  for (int i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
    int currentElement = arr[i];
    int j = i - 1;
    while (j >= 0 && arr[j] > currentElement) {
      arr[j + 1] = arr[j];
      j--;
    }
    arr[j + 1] = currentElement;
  }
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
