VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Suggest a way to convert a decimal number to binary.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Suggest a way to convert a decimal number to binary.
**Input Specification**:
```
int number = 15
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
string decimalToBinary(int number) {
    string binaryNum = "";
    while(number > 0) {
        binaryNum = (number % 2 == 0 ? "0" : "1") + binaryNum;
        number = Math.trunc(number / 2);
    }
    return binaryNum;
}
```

