INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Suggest a way to sort a given array using insertion sort algorithm.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Suggest a way to sort a given array using insertion sort algorithm.
**Input Specification**:
```
int arr[] = {82, 2, 25, 14, 5, 9}
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
void insertionSort(int arr[], int n) {
    int i, key, j;
    for (i = 1; i < n; i++) { 
        key = arr[i]; 
        j = i - 1; 
        while (j >= 0 && arr[j] > key) { 
            arr[j + 1] = arr[j]; 
            j = j - 1; 
        } 
        arr[j + 1] = key; 
    }
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Suggest a way to sort a given array using insertion sort algorithm.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
