INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a code snippet to delete all elements from a linked list.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a code snippet to delete all elements from a linked list.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
# Function to delete all the elements 
# of the linked list 
def deleteList(head_node): 
    # Store head node 
    curr = head_node 
    prev = None

    # Traverse the list and delete 
    # each node one by one 
    while(curr): 
        # Next node  
        next = curr.next
        # Free the current node 
        curr = None
        # Update prev and curr node 
        prev = curr 
        curr = next
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Write a code snippet to delete all elements from a linked list.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
