VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Build a program in C++ which finds the largest element in an array.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Build a program in C++ which finds the largest element in an array.
**Input Specification**:
```
int arr[] = {2, 3, 5, 8, 9}
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <iostream> 
using namespace std;

// Finds the largest element in the array 
int findLargestElement(int arr[], int n) 
{ 
	// Initialize maximum element 
	int max = arr[0]; 

	// Traverse array elements from second and 
	// compare every element with current max 
	for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) 
		if (arr[i] > max) 
			max = arr[i]; 

	return max; 
} 

// Driven program 
int main() 
{ 
	int arr[] = {2, 3, 5, 8, 9}; 
	int n = sizeof(arr) / sizeof(arr[0]); 
	
	cout << "Largest Element = " << findLargestElement(arr, n); 
	
	return 0; 
}
```

