VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Construct a function in Java to validate whether an input integer is a prime number.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Construct a function in Java to validate whether an input integer is a prime number.
**Input Specification**:
```
int n = 7
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static boolean isPrime(int n) 
{ 
    // Corner case 
    if (n <= 1) 
        return false; 
  
    // Check from 2 to n-1 
    for (int i = 2; i < n; i++) 
        if (n % i == 0) 
            return false; 
  
    return true; 
}
```

