VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Build a program in C to find all prime numbers within a given range.

**Role**: Machine Learning Engineer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Build a program in C to find all prime numbers within a given range.
**Input Specification**:
```
int lower = 1;
int upper = 20;
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <stdio.h>  
void primeCount(int lower, int upper) 
{ 
    while (lower < upper) { 
        int flag = 0; 
  
        for (int i = 2; i <= lower / 2; ++i) { 
            if (lower % i == 0) { 
                flag = 1; 
                break; 
            } 
        } 
  
        if (flag == 0) 
            printf("%d ", lower); 
  
        ++lower; 
    } 
} 
  
// Driver program 
int main() 
{ 
    int lower = 1;
    int upper = 20;
    primeCount(lower, upper); 
    return 0; 
}
```

