INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Find the longest common subsequence for two strings in C++.

**Role**: Database Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Find the longest common subsequence for two strings in C++.
**Input Specification**:
```
String 1: "abcdef"
String 2: "abdee"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
int LCS(string X, string Y, int m, int n)
{
    int L[m + 1][n + 1];
    int i, j;

    for (i = 0; i <= m; i++)
    {
        for (j = 0; j <= n; j++)
        {
            if (i == 0 || j == 0)
                L[i][j] = 0;
            else if (X[i - 1] == Y[j - 1])
                L[i][j] = L[i - 1][j - 1] + 1;
            else
                L[i][j] = max(L[i - 1][j], L[i][j - 1]);
        }
    }

    return L[m][n];
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Database Developer", "role_id": "database_developer", "topic": "SQL Queries & Schema Design", "subtopic": "Find the longest common subsequence for two strings in C++.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
