INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write an algorithm that takes in an array and determines if it is a valid BST.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write an algorithm that takes in an array and determines if it is a valid BST.
**Input Specification**:
```
[9, 7, 3, 15, 20]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def is_valid_bst(arr):
    if len(arr) == 0:
        return True
    if len(arr) == 1:
        return True

    root_val = arr[0]
    left_subtree = [i for i in arr if i < root_val]
    right_subtree = [i for i in arr if i > root_val]

    if sorted(left_subtree) == left_subtree and sorted(right_subtree, reverse=True) == right_subtree:
        return (is_valid_bst(left_subtree) and is_valid_bst(right_subtree))
    else:
        return False

if __name__ == "__main__":
    print(is_valid_bst([9, 7, 3, 15, 20]))
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Write an algorithm that takes in an array and determines if it is a valid BST.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
