INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Code an algorithm to reverse an array of integers.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Code an algorithm to reverse an array of integers.
**Input Specification**:
```
[1, 3, 4, 6, 8]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def reverse_array(arr):
    left_index = 0
    right_index = len(arr) - 1

    while left_index < right_index:
        arr[left_index], arr[right_index] = arr[right_index], arr[left_index]
        left_index += 1
        right_index -= 1
    return arr

if __name__ == "__main__":
    print(reverse_array([1, 3, 4, 6, 8]))
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Code an algorithm to reverse an array of integers.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
