INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Given a number N, write a function to check if N is prime.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Given a number N, write a function to check if N is prime.
**Input Specification**:
```
Number: 11
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function isPrime(n)
{
    // alleven numbers are not prime
    if (n % 2 == 0) return false;

    // check odd divisors b/w 3 and sqrt(n)
    let limit = Math.sqrt(n);
    for (let i = 3; i <= limit; i=i+2)
    {
        // if evenly divisible then not prime
        if (n % i == 0) return false;
    }
	
    return true;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Given a number N, write a function to check if N is prime.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
