INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Sort a list of integers in ascending order using selection sort.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Sort a list of integers in ascending order using selection sort.
**Input Specification**:
```
[ 9, 5, 2, 0, 7, 4, 1, 8, 6, 3]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def selection_sort(list): 

    for i in range(len(list)): 
  
        min_idx = i 
        for j in range(i+1, len(list)): 
            if list[min_idx] > list[j]: 
                min_idx = j
        list[i], list[min_idx] = list[min_idx], list[i]

list = [9, 5, 2, 0, 7, 4, 1, 8, 6, 3]
selection_sort(list) 
print ("Sorted array:", list)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Sort a list of integers in ascending order using selection sort.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
