INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement a function that takes two strings and checks whether they are anagrams.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement a function that takes two strings and checks whether they are anagrams.
**Input Specification**:
```
str1 = "cinema"
str2 = "iceman"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def anagram_checker(str1, str2):
    if len(str1) != len(str2):
        return False
    else:
        char_list1 = [0] * 26
        for char in str1:
            char_list1[ord(char)-97] += 1
        for char in str2:
            if char_list1[ord(char)-97] == 0:
                return False
            char_list1[ord(char)-97] -= 1
        return True
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Implement a function that takes two strings and checks whether they are anagrams", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
