#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def cal_gcd(n1, n2): 
   if n2 == 0: 
       return n1 
   else: 
       return cal_gcd(n2, n1 % n2) 
 
gcd = cal_gcd(n1, n2) 
print ("GCD of " + str(n1) + " and " + str(n2) + " is " + str(gcd))
