INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Print the decimal equivalent of a given binary number.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Print the decimal equivalent of a given binary number.
**Input Specification**:
```
11100011
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def binToDecimal(num): 
    # Initializing base  
    # value to 1, i.e 2^0 
    base = 1; 
      
    dec_val = 0; 
      
    # Extracting digits of  
    # binary number from   
    # the right most side 
    # and keeping  
    # incrementing the base 
    # by multiply of 2 
    temp = num 
    while(temp): 
        last_digit = temp % 10; 
        temp = int(temp / 10); 
          
        dec_val += last_digit * base; 
        base = base * 2; 
      
    return dec_val
num = 11100011
print(''Decimal Equivalent of'',num,''is'',binToDecimal(num))
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Print the decimal equivalent of a given binary number.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
