VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement a thread pool in Java.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement a thread pool in Java.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
import java.util.concurrent.ExecutorService;
import java.util.concurrent.Executors;

public class ThreadPool {
  private ExecutorService executor;

  public ThreadPool(int size) {
    this.executor = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(size);
  }

  public void submit(Runnable task) {
    this.executor.execute(task);
  }

  public void shutdown() {
    this.executor.shutdown();
  }
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
