INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Calculate the LCM (Least Common Multiple) of two integers.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Calculate the LCM (Least Common Multiple) of two integers.
**Input Specification**:
```
int x = 15;
int y = 10;
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def lcm(x, y): 
    if x > y:
        greater = x 
    else:
        greater = y 
    while(True): 
        if((greater % x == 0) and (greater % y == 0)): 
            lcm = greater 
            break
        greater += 1 
    return lcm 
  
x = 15
y = 10
print("The L.C.M. is", lcm(x, y))
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
