VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a Java program to check if a given number is prime.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a Java program to check if a given number is prime.
**Input Specification**:
```
int n = 17;
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class PrimeNumber {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int n = 17; 
        boolean flag = false;
        for(int i = 2; i <= n/2; ++i) {
            if(n % i == 0) {
                flag = true;
                break;
            }
        }
        if (!flag)
            System.out.println(n + " is a prime number.");
        else
            System.out.println(n + " is not a prime number.");
    }
}
```

