VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Design a Java function to convert a string to uppercase.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Design a Java function to convert a string to uppercase.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public String toUpperCase(String str){ 
    char[] charArr = str.toCharArray(); 

    for(int i=0; i<str.length(); i++){ 
        if(charArr[i] >= ''a'' && charArr[i] <= ''z''){ 
            charArr[i] = (char)(charArr[i] - 32); 
        } 
    } 

    return new String(charArr); 
}
```

