**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Develop a C program for swapping two variables.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <stdio.h>
 
void swap(int *x, int *y)
{
    int temp = *x;
    *x = *y;
    *y = temp;
}
 
int main()
{
    int x = 10, y = 20;
 
    // Call swap function to swap ''x'' and ''y''
    swap(&x, &y);
 
    printf("x = %d, y = %d", x, y);
    return 0;
}
