INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function in Java to find the element that appears most frequently in the array.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a function in Java to find the element that appears most frequently in the array.
**Input Specification**:
```
[9, 5, 1, 0, 4, 5, 9, 2, 8]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static int mostFrequentElement(int[] arr) { 
  int count = 0; 
  int maxCount = 0; 
  int mostFrequent = arr[0]; 
  
  for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) { 
    count = 0; 
    for (int j = 0; j < arr.length; j++) { 
      if(arr[i] == arr[j]) { 
        count++; 
      } 
      if (count > maxCount) { 
        maxCount = count; 
        mostFrequent = arr[i]; 
      } 
    } 
  } 
  return mostFrequent; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
