INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function to calculate the Fibonacci series from 0 to n.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a function to calculate the Fibonacci series from 0 to n.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def fibonacci(n): 
    a = 0
    b = 1
    if n < 0: 
        print("Incorrect input") 
    elif n == 0: 
        return a 
    elif n == 1: 
        return b 
    else: 
        for i in range(2, n+1): 
            c = a + b 
            a = b 
            b = c 
        return b
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a function to calculate the Fibonacci series from 0 to n.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
