VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a C program to sum the digits of a positive integer.

**Role**: DevOps / Cloud Engineer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a C program to sum the digits of a positive integer.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <stdio.h> 
 
int main() 
{ 
    int num, sum = 0, r; 
  
    printf("Enter a positive number: "); 
    scanf("%d", &num); 
  
    while (num > 0) { 
        r = num % 10; 
        sum += r; 
        num = num / 10; 
    } 
  
    printf("Sum of digits of the number: %d\n", sum); 
    return 0; 
}
```

