VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a Java function to classify a given set of numbers into even and odd.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Write a Java function to classify a given set of numbers into even and odd.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static void classifyNumber(int[] numbers) {
  for (int num : numbers) {
      if (num % 2 == 0) {
          System.out.println(num + " is even");
      } else {
          System.out.println(num + " is odd");
      }
  }
}
```

