INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement a function to sort an array in ascending order.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement a function to sort an array in ascending order.
**Input Specification**:
```
Array: [7, 19, 5, 4, 16]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def sortArray(arr):
    for i in range(len(arr)):
        for j in range(1, len(arr)):
            if arr[j] < arr[j-1]:
                arr[j], arr[j-1] = arr[j-1], arr[j]
    return arr

sortArray([7, 19, 5, 4, 16]) # [4, 5, 7, 16, 19]
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
