INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create an algorithm that finds the greatest common divisor of two integers.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create an algorithm that finds the greatest common divisor of two integers.
**Input Specification**:
```
x = 20 
y = 12
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def find_gcd(x,y):
   
    # If x is greater than y
    # Swapping the x and y
    if x > y:
        tmp = x
        x = y
        y = tmp

    while y > 0:
        tmp = y
        y = x % y
        x = tmp
    return x

gcd = find_gcd(20,12)
print("The greatest common divisor of 20 and 12 is: ", gcd)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create an algorithm that finds the greatest common divisor of two integers.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
