VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create an algorithm to solve the Tower of Hanoi problem.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create an algorithm to solve the Tower of Hanoi problem.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def TowerOfHanoi(n , from_rod, to_rod, aux_rod): 
    if n == 1: 
        print ("Move disk 1 from rod",from_rod,"to rod",to_rod) 
        return
    TowerOfHanoi(n-1, from_rod, aux_rod, to_rod) 
    print ("Move disk",n,"from rod",from_rod,"to rod",to_rod) 
    TowerOfHanoi(n-1, aux_rod, to_rod, from_rod)
```

