INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function in Javascript to check if a given list is palindrome.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Write a function in Javascript to check if a given list is palindrome.
**Input Specification**:
```
let list = [1, 2, 3, 3, 2, 1]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function isPalindrome(list) {
    for (let i = 0; i < Math.floor(list.length / 2); i++) {
        if (list[i] !== list[list.length - i - 1]) {
            return false;
        }
    }
    return true;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
