INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Design an algorithm to check if a number is a palindrome.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Design an algorithm to check if a number is a palindrome.
**Input Specification**:
```
7337
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def is_palindrome(num):
    num_str = str(num)
    # compare the first and last characters
    if num_str[0] != num_str[-1]:
        return False
    # go to the next pair of characters
    if len(num_str) >= 3:
        return is_palindrome(num_str[1:-1])
    # all characters have been compared, number is a palindrome
    return True
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Design an algorithm to check if a number is a palindrome.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
