```
def lowest_common_multiple(x, y):
    pass
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def lowest_common_multiple(x, y): 
    if x > y:
        greater = x
    else:
        greater = y
    while(True): 
        if((greater % x == 0) and (greater % y == 0)): 
            lcm = greater 
            break
        greater += 1
    return lcm
```

