VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Modify the following code to turn it into an Insertion Sort algorithm.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Modify the following code to turn it into an Insertion Sort algorithm.
**Input Specification**:
```
def sort_numbers(arr):
    pass
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def insertion_sort(arr): 
    for i in range(1, len(arr)):
        x = arr[i]
        j = i-1
        while j >= 0 and arr[j] > x:
            arr[j+1] = arr[j]
            j -= 1
        arr[j+1] = x
    return arr
```

