VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create an assembler program to count the number of vowels in a given string.

**Role**: AI Engineer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create an assembler program to count the number of vowels in a given string.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
section .data

str: db "Hello World", 0
len: equ $-str

vowels db 0

section .text

global main

main:
    mov edx, len
    mov esi, str
    
    xor eax, eax
    xor ebx, ebx

while_check:
   cmp ebx, edx 
    je result_print
    
    mov al, [esi + ebx]
    inc ebx
    cmp al, ''a''
    je increment_vowel
    cmp al, ''e''
    je increment_vowel
    cmp al, ''i''
    je increment_vowel
    cmp al, ''o''
    je increment_vowel
    cmp al, ''u''
    je increment_vowel
    jmp while_check

increment_vowel:
    inc [vowels]
    jmp while_check

result_print:
    mov edx, [vowels]
    mov eax, 4
    mov ebx, 1
    int 80h

mov eax, 1
mov ebx, 0
int 80h
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
