INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function to search for an element within a linked list.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a function to search for an element within a linked list.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def search(head, target): 
    curr = head
    while (curr!= None): 
        if (curr.data == target): 
            return curr.data 
        curr = curr.next
    return -1
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
