INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function in Python to find the highest common factor (HCF) of two numbers.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a function in Python to find the highest common factor (HCF) of two numbers.
**Input Specification**:
```
a = 30 / b = 12
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def hcf(a, b):
    j = min(a,b)
    hcf = 1
    for i in range(2, j+1):
        if(a%i == 0 and b%i == 0):
            hcf = i
    
    return hcf
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a function in Python to find the highest common factor (HCF) of two numbe", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
