INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Generate a code using C language to check whether a string is palindrome or not.

**Role**: DevOps / Cloud Engineer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Generate a code using C language to check whether a string is palindrome or not.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <stdio.h> 
#include <string.h> 
  
int check_palindrome(char str[]) 
{ 
    int l = 0; 
    int h = strlen(str) - 1; 
  
    while (h > l) 
    { 
        if (str[l++] != str[h--]) 
        { 
            return 0; 
        } 
    } 
    return 1; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "DevOps / Cloud Engineer", "role_id": "devops_cloud_engineer", "topic": "Bash & Automation Scripts", "subtopic": "Generate a code using C language to check whether a string is palindrome or not.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
