INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function to extract the top 10 keywords from a given text.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a function to extract the top 10 keywords from a given text.
**Input Specification**:
```
text = "This is some text that I am using to test the extractKeywords function."
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
import nltk

def extractKeywords(text):
    tokens = nltk.word_tokenize(text)
    tags = nltk.pos_tag(tokens)
    keywords = [word for word,pos in tags 
            if (pos == ''NN'' or pos == ''NNP'' or pos == ''NNS'' or pos == ''NNPS'')]
    freqs = nltk.FreqDist(keywords)
    top_ten = freqs.most_common(10)
    return top_ten
 
if __name__ == "__main__": 
    text = "This is some text that I am using to test the extractKeywords function."
    top_ten = extractKeywords(text)
    print(top_ten)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a function to extract the top 10 keywords from a given text.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
