**Input Specification**:
```
input_string = "Hello, world"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def find_most_frequent_character(input_string):
    char_count_dict = {}
    for char in input_string:
        if char in char_count_dict.keys():
            char_count_dict[char] += 1
        else:
            char_count_dict[char] = 1
    max_count = 0
    max_char = ''''
    for char in char_count_dict.keys():
        if char_count_dict[char] > max_count:
            max_count = char_count_dict[char]
            max_char = char
    return max_char
```

