VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a Java program to find the common elements between two arrays.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a Java program to find the common elements between two arrays.
**Input Specification**:
```
int[] arr1 = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}
int[] arr2 = {2, 5, 6, 7}
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
import java.util.Arrays;

public class CommonElements {
    
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] arr1 = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
        int[] arr2 = {2, 5, 6, 7};
        
        for(int i=0; i < arr1.length; i++){
            for(int j = 0; j < arr2.length; j++) 
                if(arr1[i] == arr2[j]) 
                    System.out.println(arr1[i]);
        }
    }
}
```

