VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function that calculates the sum of the digits of a number.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a function that calculates the sum of the digits of a number.
**Input Specification**:
```
Number: 13
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def sum_of_digits(n): 
    # handle negative numbers 
    n = abs(n)

    # base case when n has only one digit
    if n < 10: 
        return n 

    # calculate the sum of the digits recursively  
    else: 
        return (n % 10 + sum_of_digits(int(n / 10))) 

print(sum_of_digits(13))
```

