VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create an algorithm to generate all possible subsets of a given set of elements.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create an algorithm to generate all possible subsets of a given set of elements.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
The following algorithm can be used to generate all possible subsets of a given set of elements:
1. Create an empty list to store the subsets.
2. Iterate over each element in the given set and for each element:
     a. Add the element to the list of subsets.
     b. For each subset in the list:
        i. Create a new subset with the element added to the existing subset.
        ii. Add the new subset to the list of subsets.
3. Return the list of subsets.
```

