INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Sort a given array in ascending order using the Gnome sort algorithm.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Sort a given array in ascending order using the Gnome sort algorithm.
**Input Specification**:
```
array = [8, 3, 6, 1, 5]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def gnome_sort(array):
    i = 1
    while i < len(array): 
        if array[i-1] <= array[i]: 
            i += 1
        else: 
            array[i-1], array[i] = array[i], array[i-1] 
            i -= 1
            if (i == 0): 
                i = 1
    return array
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Sort a given array in ascending order using the Gnome sort algorithm.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
