Create an algorithm to reverse a linked list in place.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
class Node:
    def __init__(self, data):
        self.data = data
        self.next = None 

def reverse_list(head):
    prev = None
    current = head
    while current:
        next = current.next
        current.next = prev
        prev = current
        current = next
    head = prev
    return head
```

