INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function in JavaScript to print the Fibonacci sequence up to the given number.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Write a function in JavaScript to print the Fibonacci sequence up to the given number.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function fibonacciSequence(n) {
    let sequence = [0, 1]
    let i = 2 
    while (i < n) {
        sequence.push(sequence[i - 2] + sequence[i - 1]);
        i++;
    }
    return sequence;
}
```

