INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create your own sorting algorithm

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create your own sorting algorithm
**Input Specification**:
```
[3, 6, 4, 7, 1, 2]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def my_sort(arr):
    length = len(arr) 
	for i in range(length): 
		min_ind = i 
		for j in range(i+1, length): 
			if arr[ min_ind ] > arr[j]: 
				min_ind = j 
		arr[i], arr[min_ind] = arr[min_ind], arr[i]
	return arr
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create your own sorting algorithm", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
