VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Suggest an algorithm to remove duplicates from an array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Suggest an algorithm to remove duplicates from an array.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def remove_duplicates(arr):
    # Create a seen set
    seen = set()
    # Iterate through the array
    for i in range(len(arr)):
        # If element is already seen, remove it
        if arr[i] in seen:
            del arr[i]
        # Else add element to seen set
        else:
            seen.add(arr[i])
    return arr
```

