INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a JavaScript function to generate all possible combinations of a given set of elements.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a JavaScript function to generate all possible combinations of a given set of elements.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function getCombinations(array) {
  let result = [];
  for (let i = 0;i < array.length; i++) {
    let current = array.splice(i, 1);
    let tempArray = array.slice();
    if (array.length > 1) {
      let tempPermutations = getCombinations(tempArray);
      tempPermutations.forEach(permutations => {
        result.push(current.concat(permutations));
      });
    } else {
      result.push(current.concat(array));
    }
    array.splice(i, 0, current[0]);
  }
  return result;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Write a JavaScript function to generate all possible combinations of a given set", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
