INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Generate a sorted list of numbers in an array using insertion sort?

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Generate a sorted list of numbers in an array using insertion sort?
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [5, 8, 1, 7, 2, 10, 3]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def insertion_sort(arr):
    for i in range(len(arr)):
        key = arr[i]
        j = i-1
        while j >= 0 and arr[j] > key:
            arr[j+1] = arr[j]
            j -= 1
        arr[j+1] = key
    return arr
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Generate a sorted list of numbers in an array using insertion sort?", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
