VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a Java program to convert a binary string to a decimal number.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a Java program to convert a binary string to a decimal number.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class BinaryToDecimal { 

	public static int binToDecimal(String binaryNumber)  
	{  
		int decimal = 0;  
		int power = 0;  
		for(int i = binaryNumber.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--)  
		{   
			if (binaryNumber.charAt(i) == ''1'') 
				decimal += Math.pow(2, power); 
			power++; 
		}  
		return decimal;  
	}  
	
}
```

