INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a code to check if a number is an Armstrong number or not

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a code to check if a number is an Armstrong number or not

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def isArmstrongNumber(num):  
    # initialize
    sum_times_powers = 0
    temp = num  
  
    while (temp != 0):  
        # find remainder and get it
        remainder = temp % 10 
        sum_times_powers += remainder ** 3 
        temp //= 10
  
    if (sum_times_powers == num):  
        return True
    else: 
        return False
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a code to check if a number is an Armstrong number or not", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
