INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Rewrite the following in-place insertion sort algorithm in Java.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Rewrite the following in-place insertion sort algorithm in Java.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class InsertionSort { 
	public static void inplaceInsertionSort(int[] array) { 
		// Iterate over array elements 
		for (int i = 1; i < array.length; i++) { 
			int value = array[i]; 
			int j = i; 
			// Check whether the adjacent element in 
			// left side is greater or not 
			while (j > 0 && array[j - 1] > value) { 
				// shifting the elements 
				array[j] = array[j - 1]; 
				j--; 
			} 
			// moving the element in right side 
			array[j] = value; 
		} 
	} 
	// Driver Code 
	public static void main(String[] args) { 
		int[] arr = { 20, 12, 10, 15, 2 }; 
		inplaceInsertionSort(arr); 
		for (int i : arr) { 
			System.out.print(i + " "); 
		} 

	}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Rewrite the following in-place insertion sort algorithm in Java.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
