INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement an iterator in Python for the following string.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement an iterator in Python for the following string.
**Input Specification**:
```
string = ''Hello World!''
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
class Iterator:
    def __init__(self, data):
        self.data = data
        self.index = 0

    def __iter__(self):
        return self

    def __next__(self):
        if self.index >= len(self.data):
            raise StopIteration
        char = self.data[self.index]
        self.index += 1
        return char

iterator = Iterator(string)
for char in iterator:
    print(char)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Implement an iterator in Python for the following string.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
