VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Design a database schema to track course registrations in a university.

**Role**: Database Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Design a database schema to track course registrations in a university.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
CREATE TABLE students (
  id INT AUTO_INCREMENT,
  name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (id)
);

CREATE TABLE courses (
  id INT AUTO_INCREMENT,
  title VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (id)
);

CREATE TABLE registrations (
  student_id INT NOT NULL,
  course_id INT NOT NULL,
  FOREIGN KEY (student_id) REFERENCES students(id),
  FOREIGN KEY (course_id) REFERENCES courses(id)
);
```

