INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function in Java to compute the standard deviation of an array of real numbers.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a function in Java to compute the standard deviation of an array of real numbers.
**Input Specification**:
```
float[] data = {3.3, 5.6, 7.8, 5.4, 9.9};
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static double StandardDev(float[] data) 
{ 
    double mean = 0.0, sum_deviation = 0.0; 
    for(double num : data) 
        mean += num; 
    mean = mean / data.length; 
    for(double num: data) 
        sum_deviation += (num - mean)*(num - mean); 
    return Math.sqrt(sum_deviation / data.length); 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Write a function in Java to compute the standard deviation of an array of real n", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
