VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a code to check if the string has all unique characters in Python

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a code to check if the string has all unique characters in Python

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def isUnique(string): 
 
    # Assuming character set is ASCII (128 characters) 
    if len(string) > 128: 
        return False
 
    char_set = [False for _ in range(128)] 
    for char in string: 
        char_value = ord(char) 
 
        if char_set[char_value]: 
            return False
 
        char_set[char_value] = True
 
    return True
```

