- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create an iOS app that calculates and shows the currency conversion rate between", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
