INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function in Python that takes a string as an input and returns TRUE if it is a palindrome or FALSE if it is not.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a function in Python that takes a string as an input and returns TRUE if it is a palindrome or FALSE if it is not.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def is_palindrome(string): 
    left_pos = 0
    right_pos = len(string) - 1
    
    while right_pos >= left_pos: 
        if not string[left_pos] == string[right_pos]: 
            return False
        left_pos += 1
        right_pos -= 1
    return True
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a function in Python that takes a string as an input and returns TRUE if ", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
