INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Find the most frequently occurring element in an array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Find the most frequently occurring element in an array.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def most_frequent_element(arr): 
    # Create a dictionary to store the frequency of each element
    freq = {} 
    max_freq = 0
    max_freq_elem = -1
    
    # Iterate through an array 
    for elem in arr: 
        if elem in freq.keys(): 
            freq[elem] += 1
        else: 
            freq[elem] = 1
  
    # Find the most frequent element
    for key,val in freq.items(): 
        # Update the maximum frequency and the corresponding element
        if (max_freq < val): 
            max_freq_elem = key 
            max_freq = val 
    return max_freq_elem
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Find the most frequently occurring element in an array.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
