INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create an R function to find the mode of a given data set

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Create an R function to find the mode of a given data set
**Input Specification**:
```
data.set = c(1,2,3,3,3,4,5)
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
mode <- function(x) {
  freq <- table(x)
  maxfreq <- max(freq)
  vars <- names(freq)[freq == maxfreq]
  return(vars)
}

mode(data.set) 

# Output
# [1] 3
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
