VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function in Rust that takes two strings and returns true if they are anagrams.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Create a function in Rust that takes two strings and returns true if they are anagrams.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
fn anagrams(s1: &str, s2: &str) -> bool {
    let s1 = s1.to_lowercase().chars().collect::<Vec<char>>();
    let s2 = s2.to_lowercase().chars().collect::<Vec<char>>();
    s1.sort_unstable();
    s2.sort_unstable();
    s1 == s2
}
