INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a Node.js server that serves up a webpage when a GET request is received.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a Node.js server that serves up a webpage when a GET request is received.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
const http = require(''http'');
const fs = require(''fs'');

const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {
  if (req.method === ''GET'' && req.url === ''/'') {
    fs.readFile(''index.html'', (err, data) => {
      res.writeHead(200, { ''Content-Type'': ''text/html'' });
      res.end(data);
    });
  }
});

server.listen(8000);
```

