INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement a binary search algorithm with a given input array.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Implement a binary search algorithm with a given input array.
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [2, 3, 4, 8, 10, 42, 56, 78, 89]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
// Binary Search Algorithm 

function binarySearch(arr, x) { 
  
    let start=0, end=arr.length-1; 
          
    // Iterate while start not meets end 
    while (start<=end) { 
  
        // Find the mid index 
        let mid=Math.floor((start + end)/2); 
  
        // If element is present at mid, return True 
        if (arr[mid]===x) return true; 
  
        // Else look in left or right half accordingly 
        else if (arr[mid] < x)  
             start = mid + 1; 
        else
             end = mid - 1; 
    } 
  
    return false; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Implement a binary search algorithm with a given input array.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
