VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a code in Java for finding the factorial of a number.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a code in Java for finding the factorial of a number.
**Input Specification**:
```
5
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class Factorial {
 
  public static int calcFactorial(int number){
    int factorial;
 
    if(number == 0 || number == 1){
      factorial = 1;
    } else {
      factorial = number * calcFactorial(number-1);
    }
    return factorial;
  }
 
  public static void main(String[] args){
    System.out.println(calcFactorial(5));
  }
}
```

