INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a C++ function to calculate the maximum subarray sum of a given array.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a C++ function to calculate the maximum subarray sum of a given array.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
int maxSumSubArray(vector<int> arr) 
{ 
    int max_so_far = arr[0]; 
    int curr_max = arr[0]; 
  
    for (int i = 1; i < arr.size(); i++) 
    { 
        curr_max = max(arr[i], curr_max+arr[i]); 
        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, curr_max); 
    } 
    return max_so_far; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Write a C++ function to calculate the maximum subarray sum of a given array.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
