#### Problem Description
Given an array, write a JavaScript snippet to return an object of frequencies for each element.
**Input Specification**:
```
Array: [1, 2, 2, 3, 4, 5]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
const nums = [1, 2, 2, 3, 4, 5];

const freq = {};

for (let num of nums) {
  if (freq[num]) {
    freq[num]++;
  } else {
    freq[num] = 1;
  }
}

console.log(freq); // {1: 1, 2: 2, 3: 1, 4: 1, 5: 1}
```

