VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: What is an example of a bubble sort algorithm?

**Role**: Backend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
What is an example of a bubble sort algorithm?

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
Example of a bubble sort algorithm:

void bubble_sort(int arr[], int n) 
{ 
   int i, j; 
   for (i = 0; i < n-1; i++)           
       for (j = 0; j < n-i-1; j++)  
           if (arr[j] > arr[j+1]) 
              swap(&arr[j], &arr[j+1]); 
}
```

