INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Develop a JavaScript code snippet to find the maximum and minimum numbers in an array.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Develop a JavaScript code snippet to find the maximum and minimum numbers in an array.
**Input Specification**:
```
nums = [2, 5, 8, 9, 10]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function maxmin(nums) {  
    let max = nums[0];
    let min = nums[0];
  
    for (let i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
        // comparison to find the maximum
        if (nums[i] > max) {
            max = nums[i];
        }
        // comparison to find the minimum
        if (nums[i] < min) {
            min = nums[i];
        }
    }
    
    return {max:max, min:min};  
}

//driver code
let nums = [2, 5, 8, 9, 10];
let maxmin_result = maxmin(nums);
console.log(`Max is ${maxmin_result.max}, and min is ${maxmin_result.min}.`);
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Develop a JavaScript code snippet to find the maximum and minimum numbers in an ", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
