INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Develop a Python program

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Develop a Python program
**Input Specification**:
```
Create a program to validate an ISBN number.
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def is_valid_isbn(isbn):
    isbn_length = len(isbn)
    if isbn_length != 10:
        return False
   
    # Calculate the check digit
    sum = 0
    for i in range(9):
        sum += (i+1) * int(isbn[i])
    check_digit = sum % 11
   
    # Check if the check digit matches the last character of the ISBN.
    if check_digit == 10 and isbn[-1].upper() != ''X'':
        return False
    elif check_digit < 10 and int(isbn[-1]) != check_digit:
        return False
    else:
        return True
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Develop a Python program", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
