String1 = "Hellocat"
String2 = "Hellokong"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def longestCommonPrefix(str1, str2): 
    n1 = len(str1) 
    n2 = len(str2) 
  
    result = "" 
    j = 0
    i = 0
    while(i <= n1 - 1 and j <= n2 - 1): 
        if (str1[i] != str2[j]): 
            break
        result += str1[i] 
        i += 1
        j += 1
  
    return result
```

