VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Using C++, write a program to find the Fibonacci number at a given position.

**Role**: Backend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Using C++, write a program to find the Fibonacci number at a given position.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
int Fibonacci(int n) 
{ 
    int a = 0, b = 1, c, i; 
    if( n == 0) 
        return a; 
    for (i = 2; i <= n; i++) 
    { 
        c = a + b; 
        a = b; 
        b = c; 
    } 
    return b; 
}
```

