VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Compose a program to sort an array of integers using bubble sort.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Compose a program to sort an array of integers using bubble sort.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def bubbleSort(arr): 
    n = len(arr) 
    for i in range(n): 
        for j in range(0, n-i-1): 
            if arr[j] > arr[j+1] : 
                arr[j], arr[j+1] = arr[j+1], arr[j]
```

