INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write JavaScript code to add the following data to the web page.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write JavaScript code to add the following data to the web page.
**Input Specification**:
```
[
        { name: "John", age: 25 },
        { name: "Rob", age: 27 },
        { name: "Mia", age: 22 }
]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
let data = [
    { name: "John", age: 25 },
    { name: "Rob", age: 27 },
    { name: "Mia", age: 22 }
];

let table = document.createElement("table");
table.setAttribute("id", "personTable");

let thead = document.createElement("thead");
let tr = document.createElement("tr");
let th = document.createElement("th");
th.innerText = "Name";
tr.appendChild(th);
let th1 = document.createElement("th");
th1.innerText = "Age";
tr.appendChild(th1);
thead.appendChild(tr);

let tbody = document.createElement("tbody");

data.map(value => {
    let tr1 = document.createElement("tr");
    Object.values(value).map(val => {
        let td = document.createElement("td");
        td.innerText = val;
        tr1.appendChild(td);
    })
    tbody.appendChild(tr1);
});

table.appendChild(thead);
table.appendChild(tbody);
document.body.appendChild(table);
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Write JavaScript code to add the following data to the web page.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
