#### Problem Description
Implement a function to delete a node in a linked list

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def delete_node(node):
  if node is None or node.next is None:
    return
  
  next_node = node.next
  node.data = next_node.data
  node.next = next_node.next
  next_node = None
```

