INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Sort the following array in ascending order using insertion sort in JavaScript.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Sort the following array in ascending order using insertion sort in JavaScript.
**Input Specification**:
```
[7, 2, 5, 3, 8]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function insertionSort(arr) {
  for (let i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
    let currentVal = arr[i];
    for (var j = i - 1; j >= 0 && arr[j] > currentVal; j--) {
      arr[j + 1] = arr[j];
    }
    arr[j + 1] = currentVal;
  }
  return arr;
}

// Test
let arr = [7, 2, 5, 3, 8];
insertionSort(arr);
// [2, 3, 5, 7, 8]
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Sort the following array in ascending order using insertion sort in JavaScript.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
