INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a code to find the first non-duplicate character in a given string.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a code to find the first non-duplicate character in a given string.
**Input Specification**:
```
var s = "apple";
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function findFirstNonDuplicateChar(s) {
  var character = '''';
  var checker = {};
  for (var i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {
    var char = s[i];
    if (checker[char]) {
      checker[char]++;
    } else {
      checker[char] = 1;
    }
  }
  for (var i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {
    var char = s[i];
    if (checker[char] === 1) {
      character = char;
      break;
    }
  }
