VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a Java program to generate and print Fibonacci series of a given size.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a Java program to generate and print Fibonacci series of a given size.
**Input Specification**:
```
Size: 8
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class FibonacciSeries 
{ 
    public static void main(String[] args) 
    { 
        int n = 8; 
        int f1 = 0, f2 = 1; 
  
        System.out.print("The Fibonacci series of size "+n+" is : "); 
        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) 
        { 
            System.out.print(f1 + " "); 
            int next = f1 + f2; 
            f1 = f2; 
            f2 = next; 
        } 
    } 
}
```

