**Input Specification**:
```
Lower limit: 3
Upper limit: 7
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def sumOfOddNumbers(lower, upper):
    total = 0
    for i in range(lower, upper+1): 
        if (i % 2 != 0): 
            total += i
    return total
