VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Design a class to convert a given string to Morse code and store it as a list.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Design a class to convert a given string to Morse code and store it as a list.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
class MorseCodeConverter:
    def __init__(self, string):
        self.string = string
        self.alphabet = {
            ''a'': ''.-'',
            ''b'': ''-...'',
            ''c'': ''-.-.'',
            ''d'': ''-..'',
            ''e'': ''.'',
            ''f'': ''..-.'',
            ''g'': ''--.'',
            ''h'': ''....'',
            ''i'': ''..'',
            ''j'': ''.---'',
            ''k'': ''-.-'',
            ''l'': ''.-..'',
            ''m'': ''--'',
            ''n'': ''-.'',
            ''o'': ''---'',
            ''p'': ''.--.'',
            ''q'': ''--.-'',
            ''r'': ''.-.'',
            ''s'': ''...'',
            ''t'': ''-'',
            ''u'': ''..-'',
            ''v'': ''...-'',
            ''w'': ''.--'',
            ''x'': ''-..-'',
            ''y'': ''-.--'',
            ''z'': ''--..'',
            ''1'': ''.----'',
            ''2'': ''..---'',
            ''3'': ''...--'',
            ''4'': ''....-'',
            ''5'': ''.....'',
            ''6'': ''-....'',
            ''7'': ''--...'',
            ''8'': ''---..'',
            ''9'': ''----.'',
            ''0'': ''-----''
        }
    
    def convert(self):
