VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Develop a ruby program to remove all the duplicates from an array of integers.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Develop a ruby program to remove all the duplicates from an array of integers.
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [1, 2, 4, 4, 5, 2]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def remove_duplicates(arr)
    new_arr = []
    arr.each do |x|
        if !new_arr.include? x
            new_arr.push(x)
        end
    end
    return new_arr
end
```

