Given an array of integers find the index of the element that appears an odd number of times.
**Input Specification**:
```
[2, 3, 2, 4, 5, 3]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def find_odd_element(arr):
    elements = set()
    for x in arr:
        if x in elements:
            elements.remove(x)
        else:
            elements.add(x)
    return arr.index(list(elements)[0])
