INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write an algorithm in Python to determine if an array has duplicate elements or not.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write an algorithm in Python to determine if an array has duplicate elements or not.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def containsDuplicate(arr):
    seen = set()
    for element in arr:
        if element in seen:
            return True
        seen.add(element)
    return False
```

