VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a JavaScript function to convert a given number to an array.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Create a JavaScript function to convert a given number to an array.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function toArray(numb){
    let arr = [];

    while (numb > 0) {
        let remainder = numb % 10;
        numb = Math.floor(numb / 10);
        arr.unshift(remainder);
    }

    return arr;
}
```

