#### Problem Description
Implement a function for generating a list of Fibonacci numbers up to n.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def fibonacci_list(n): 
    fib_list = [1,1] 
    while fib_list[-1] < n: 
        next_num = fib_list[-1] + fib_list[-2] 
        fib_list.append(next_num)
    return fib_list
