INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Rewrite the code to implement a shell sort algorithm in Python.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Rewrite the code to implement a shell sort algorithm in Python.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def shell_sort(arr):
    n = len(arr)
    gap = n//2
 
    while gap > 0:
 
        for i in range(gap,n):
            temp = arr[i]
            j = i
            while  j >= gap and arr[j-gap] >temp:
                arr[j] = arr[j-gap]
                j -= gap
            arr[j] = temp
        gap //= 2
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Rewrite the code to implement a shell sort algorithm in Python.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
