INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a C program that takes an integer as input and prints the sum of all its digits.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a C program that takes an integer as input and prints the sum of all its digits.
**Input Specification**:
```
n = 473
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include<stdio.h> 

//Function to find the sum of digits 
int SumOfDigits(int n) 
{ 
	int sum = 0; 
	while(n>0) 
	{ 
		//Extracting the last digit of the number 
		int rem = n % 10;  
		sum = sum + rem; 
		
		//Removing the last digit from the number 
		n = n / 10; 
	} 
	return sum; 
} 

//Test Program
int main() 
{ 
	int num = 473; 
	printf("Sum of Digits of %d = %d", num, SumOfDigits(num)); 

	return 0; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Write a C program that takes an integer as input and prints the sum of all its d", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
