- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Backend Developer", "role_id": "backend_developer", "topic": "Backend Logic & Algorithms", "subtopic": "Explain how a Depth-First-Search (DFS) algorithm works.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
