INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a JavaScript function that takes an array of numbers as parameter and returns the second largest element in it.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a JavaScript function that takes an array of numbers as parameter and returns the second largest element in it.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function secondLargestElement(arr){
    let largest=arr[0];
    let second_largest=arr[0];

    for(let i=1; i<arr.length; i++){
      // If current element is 
      // greater than largest 
      if (arr[i] > largest){
        second_largest = largest; 
        largest = arr[i]; 
      }
  
      // If arr[i] is in between  
      // largest and second_largest 
      else if (arr[i] > second_largest) 
        second_largest = arr[i]; 
    }
    return second_largest; 
}
```

