INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function in Java to find the length of the longest common subsequence of two strings.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a function in Java to find the length of the longest common subsequence of two strings.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static int longestCommonSubsequence(String s1, String s2) {
    int[][] dp = new int[s1.length() + 1][s2.length() + 1];

    for (int i = 0; i <= s1.length(); i++) {
        for (int j = 0; j <= s2.length(); j++) {
            if (i == 0 || j == 0) {
                dp[i][j] = 0;
            } else if (s1.charAt(i - 1) == s2.charAt(j - 1)) {
                dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1] + 1;
            } else {
                dp[i][j] = Math.max(dp[i][j - 1], dp[i - 1][j]);
            }
        }
    }
    return dp[s1.length()][s2.length()];
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Write a function in Java to find the length of the longest common subsequence of", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
