INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Develop a python code to sort an array of numbers

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Develop a python code to sort an array of numbers

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def bubble_sort(arr): 
    n = len(arr) 
  
    # Traverse through all array elements 
    for i in range(n): 
  
        # Last i elements are already in place 
        for j in range(0, n-i-1): 
  
            # traverse the array from 0 to n-i-1 
            # Swap if the element found is greater 
            # than the next element 
            if arr[j] > arr[j+1] : 
                arr[j], arr[j+1] = arr[j+1], arr[j]
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Develop a python code to sort an array of numbers", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
