INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a recursive algorithm to sum the numbers between 1 and n (inclusive).

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Create a recursive algorithm to sum the numbers between 1 and n (inclusive).
**Input Specification**:
```
n = 5
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function recSum(n) {
  if (n === 1) return 1;
  return n + recSum(n-1);
}

// Usage
console.log(recSum(5)); // 15
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
