INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a Java method to insert a given string at the beginning of every word in a given sentence.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a Java method to insert a given string at the beginning of every word in a given sentence.
**Input Specification**:
```
String sentence = "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog";
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
String addPrefix(String sentence, String prefix) { 
  String[] words = sentence.split(" "); 
  StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder(); 

  for (String word: words) { 
    sb.append(prefix + word + " "); 
  } 
  return sb.toString(); 
}

addPrefix(sentence, "The"); // Output: "TheThe quick Thebrown Thefox Thejumps Theover Thethe Thelazy Thedog"
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
