INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a JavaScript program to create a random string of 10 characters.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a JavaScript program to create a random string of 10 characters.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function getRandomString() {
    var chars = ''ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789'';
    var randomstring = '''';
    for (var i=0; i<10; i++) {
        var rnum = Math.floor(Math.random() * chars.length);
        randomstring += chars.substring(rnum,rnum+1);
    }
    return randomstring;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
