INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a code in C++ to search for a user input word in an array.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a code in C++ to search for a user input word in an array.
**Input Specification**:
```
The user input word is "apple".
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <iostream> 
#include <algorithm>  

using namespace std; 

int SearchWord(string arr[], string target, int n) 
{ 
	int index = -1; 

	for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { 
		if (arr[i] == target) { 
			index = i; 
			break; 
		} 
	} 
	return index; 
} 

int main() 
{ 
	string arr[20] = { "apple", "banana", "grapes", "mango", "orange" }; 
	string target = "apple"; 
	int n = sizeof(arr) / sizeof(arr[0]); 
	int index = SearchWord(arr, target, n); 
	if (index != -1) 
		cout << "Found at index: " << index; 
	else
		cout << "Not found"; 
	return 0; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
