INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Given a BST, write a function to find the number of values greater than the root node.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Given a BST, write a function to find the number of values greater than the root node.
**Input Specification**:
```
25 
   /    \          
  15     35
 /  \    /  \ 
10  20  30  40
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def count_values_greater_than_root(root):
    count = 0
    if root.right:
        count += 1 + count_values_greater_than_root(root.right)
    if root.left:
        count += count_values_greater_than_root(root.left)
    return count
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Given a BST, write a function to find the number of values greater than the root", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
