INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Compute the Minkowski distance between two lists.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Compute the Minkowski distance between two lists.
**Input Specification**:
```
list_1 = [1, 2, 3]
list_2 = [-1, -2, -3]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def minkowski_distance(list_1, list_2, p):
    return (sum([abs(x-y)**p for x, y in zip(list_1, list_2)]))**(1/p)

# Result:
minkowski_distance(list_1, list_2, 3)  # 6.0
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Compute the Minkowski distance between two lists.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
