```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def int_to_binary(num):
    ''''''This function will convert an integer to its binary representation.''''''
    binary = ''''
    while num > 0:
        binary += str(num % 2)
        num //= 2
    return binary[::-1]

if __name__ == ''__main__'':
    num = 15
    print(int_to_binary(num))
```

