INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a game of rock-paper-scissors using functions and conditionals.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a game of rock-paper-scissors using functions and conditionals.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def play_game():
    """
    This function is a game of rock-paper-scissors.
    """
    import random
    player_input = input("Choose rock(r), paper(p) or scissors(s): ")
    computer_choice = random.choice(["r", "p", "s"])
    if player_input == computer_choice:
        return "It is a draw"
    elif player_input == "r":
        if computer_choice == "p":
            return "Computer Wins!"
        else:
            return "Player Wins!"
    elif player_input == "p":
        if computer_choice == "s":
            return "Computer Wins!"
        else:
            return "Player Wins!"
    elif player_input == "s":
        if computer_choice == "r":
            return "Computer Wins!"
        else:
            return "Player Wins!"
    else:
        return "Invalid input"

print(play_game())
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a game of rock-paper-scissors using functions and conditionals.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
