INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function to calculate the Average True Range of a given array of price data

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a function to calculate the Average True Range of a given array of price data
**Input Specification**:
```
[10, 15, 8, 11]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def calculate_ATR(data):
    max_diff = 0
    for i in range(1, len(data)):
        diff = abs(data[i] - data[i-1])
        if diff > max_diff:
            max_diff = diff
    return max_diff/len(data)

data = [10, 15, 8, 11]
print(calculate_ATR(data)) # 2.25
```

