INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a code to save the first ten prime numbers in an array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a code to save the first ten prime numbers in an array.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
# prime number sieve
def prime_numbers(n): 
 
    prime = [True for i in range(n+1)] 
    p = 2
    while (p * p <= n): 
        if (prime[p] == True): 
            for i in range(p * p, n+1, p): 
                prime[i] = False
        p += 1
  
    prime_numbers = []
    for p in range(2, n): 
        if prime[p]: 
            prime_numbers.append(p)
    return prime_numbers[:10]
  
if __name__ == "__main__":
    n = 100
    print(prime_numbers(n))
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a code to save the first ten prime numbers in an array.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
