INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Insert a node at a specific position in the linked list.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Insert a node at a specific position in the linked list.
**Input Specification**:
```
Linked List: 0->3->4->7
Node: 5
Position: 2
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def insert_at_pos(head, node_data, pos):
    new_node = Node(node_data)
    if pos == 0:
        new_node.next = head
        return new_node
    temp = head 
    for i in xrange(pos-1):
        temp = temp.next
    new_node.next = temp.next
    temp.next = new_node
    return head
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Insert a node at a specific position in the linked list.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
