VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a program to calculate the Greatest Common Denominator (GCD) of two numbers.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a program to calculate the Greatest Common Denominator (GCD) of two numbers.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def gcd(a, b):
    while b != 0:
        c = a % b
        a = b
        b = c
    return a
```

