INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Given a 2-D array, write a C++ code snippet to find the maximum sum of all the numbers that are strictly increasing in a diagonal pattern.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Given a 2-D array, write a C++ code snippet to find the maximum sum of all the numbers that are strictly increasing in a diagonal pattern.
**Input Specification**:
```
[[1, 2, 3], 
[4, 5, 6], 
[7, 8, 9]]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
int maxSum = 0;
 
// traverse elements in upper-left 
// to lower-right diagonal order 
for (int i = 0; i < Matrix.size(); i++ )
{
    int sum = 0; 
    // traverse diagonal element 
    for (int j = 0; (i+j) < Matrix.size() && j < Matrix.size(); j++ )
        sum += Matrix[i+j][j]; 
    // update max sum 
    maxSum = max(maxSum, sum); 
} 

// traverse elements in upper-right 
// to lower-left diagonal order 
for (int i = 1; i < Matrix.size(); i++ ) 
{ 
    int sum = 0; 
    // traverse diagonal element 
    for (int j = 0; (i+j) < Matrix.size() && j < Matrix.size(); j++ ) 
        sum += Matrix[j][i+j]; 
    // update max sum 
    maxSum = max(maxSum, sum); 
}
```

