INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Find the maximum subarray sum in an array of integers.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Find the maximum subarray sum in an array of integers.
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [-2, -3, 4, -1, -2, 1, 5, -3]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def max_subarray_sum(arr):
    """This function takes an array of integers and returns the maximum subarray sum """
    current_max = arr[0]
    overall_max = arr[0]

    for num in arr[1:]:
        current_max = max(current_max + num, num)
        overall_max = max(current_max, overall_max)

    return overall_max

# Example Usage
arr = [-2, -3, 4, -1, -2, 1, 5, -3]
max_sum = max_subarray_sum(arr)
# max_sum should be 7
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Find the maximum subarray sum in an array of integers.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
