INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement a sorting algorithm in C++.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Implement a sorting algorithm in C++.
**Input Specification**:
```
No input
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <iostream> 
using namespace std; 
int main() 
{ 
	int arr[] = {10, 7, 8, 9, 1, 5}; 
	int n = sizeof(arr)/sizeof(arr[0]); 
  
	// Bubble sort algorithm 
	for (int i = 0; i < n-1; i++)		 
		for (int j = 0; j < n-i-1; j++)  
			if (arr[j] > arr[j+1]) 
				swap(arr[j], arr[j+1]); 
  
	// Prints the sorted array 
	for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) 
		cout << arr[i] << " "; 
		
  return 0;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
