VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Design and write a code to identify the maximum number of vowels contained in any given string.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Design and write a code to identify the maximum number of vowels contained in any given string.
**Input Specification**:
```
String = "Queensland"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def vowel_count(str): 
    # making a set of vowels 
    vowels = {''a'', ''e'', ''i'', ''o'', ''u'', ''A'', ''E'', ''I'', ''O'', ''U''} 
  
    # counter variable to store the count of vowels 
    count = 0
  
    #a loop to check every character in a given string
