INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a code in Java to find all the prime numbers between 0 and n.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a code in Java to find all the prime numbers between 0 and n.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static List<Integer> findPrimes(int n) {
    List<Integer> primes = new ArrayList<>();
    for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {
        boolean isPrime = true;
        for (int j = 2; j < i; j++) {
            if (i % j == 0) {
                isPrime = false;
                break;
            }
        }
        if (isPrime) {
            primes.add(i);
        }
    }
    return primes;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Write a code in Java to find all the prime numbers between 0 and n.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
