#### Problem Description
Develop a MATLAB function to calculate the product of two matrices.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function F = matrix_mult(A,B)
  [m,n] = size(A);
  [p,q] = size(B);
  if (n~=p)
      error(''The matrices can not be multiplied'');
  end
  F = zeros(m,q);
  for i=1:m
      for j=1:q
          sum = 0;
          for k=1:n
              sum = sum + A(i,k)*B(k,j);
          end
          F(i,j) = sum;
      end
  end
end
```

