INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Find the longest substring of a string without repeating characters

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Find the longest substring of a string without repeating characters
**Input Specification**:
```
string="abcabcbb"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def longestSubstring(string): 
    start_index = max_length = 0
    visited = {} 
  
    # traverse through the string  
    for i in range(len(string)):  
        if string[i] in visited and start_index <= visited[string[i]]: 
            start_index = visited[string[i]] + 1
        else: 
            max_length = max(max_length, i - start_index + 1) 
  
        visited[string[i]] = i 
  
    return max_length
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Find the longest substring of a string without repeating characters", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
