VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement a function to retrieve the nth node of the singly-linked list

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement a function to retrieve the nth node of the singly-linked list

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def getNthNode(head, n): 
    if n == 0:
        return head.value 
    current = head 
    for _ in range (n):
        if not current.next : 
            return None
        current = current.next 
    return current.value
```

