INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Parse a given expression tree to evaluate the result

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Parse a given expression tree to evaluate the result

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def evaluate(root):
    # empty tree
    if root is None:
        return 0
    # leaf node
    if root.left is None and root.right is None:
        return int(root.data)
    # evaluate left tree
    left_sum = evaluate(root.left)
 
    # evaluate right tree
    right_sum = evaluate(root.right)
 
    # check which operation to apply
    if root.data == ''+'':
        return left_sum + right_sum
 
    elif root.data == ''-'':
        return left_sum - right_sum
 
    elif root.data == ''*'':
        return left_sum * right_sum
 
    else:
        return left_sum / right_sum
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Parse a given expression tree to evaluate the result", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
