**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [2, 5, 9, 11, 15, 27];
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def find_greatest_difference(arr):
  max_diff = 0
  for i in range(len(arr)):
    for j in range(i+1, len(arr)):
      diff = abs(arr[i] - arr[j])
      if diff > max_diff:
        max_diff = diff

  return max_diff

# Testing
