INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a C# program to remove all adjacent duplicates from a string.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a C# program to remove all adjacent duplicates from a string.
**Input Specification**:
```
string str = "azxxzy";
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
string removeAdjacentDuplicates(string str) 
{ 
    int l = str.Length; 
    char[] array = str.ToCharArray(); 
  
    int index = 0; 
    for (int i = 0; i < l; i++) 
    { 
        if (i == 0 || array[i - 1] != array[i]) 
            array[index++] = array[i]; 
        else
            while (i + 1 < l && array[i + 1] == array[i]) 
                i++; 
    } 
  
    return new string(array, 0, index); 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Write a C# program to remove all adjacent duplicates from a string.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
