- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Backend Developer", "role_id": "backend_developer", "topic": "Backend Logic & Algorithms", "subtopic": "Create a C++ program that takes a string as input and returns the most frequentl", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
