INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a Rust program to find the lowest common ancestor in a given tree.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a Rust program to find the lowest common ancestor in a given tree.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
fn lowestCommonAncestor(root: &TreeNode, p: &TreeNode, q: &TreeNode) -> i32 {
 if root == nil {
  return -1;
 }

 if root == p || root == q {
  return root.val;
 }

 let left = lowestCommonAncestor(root.left, p, q);
 let right = lowestCommonAncestor(root.right, p, q);

 if left != -1 && right != -1 {
  return root.val;
 }

 return left != -1 ? left : right;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Write a Rust program to find the lowest common ancestor in a given tree.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
