INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write code that adds two numbers using the unary operator.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write code that adds two numbers using the unary operator.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
// Function to add two numbers using unary operator 
int addNumbers(int x, int y) 
{ 
    // Iterate till there is no carry 
    while (y != 0) 
    { 
        // carry now contains common 
        // set bits of x and y 
        int carry = x & y; 
  
        // Sum of bits of x and y where at 
        // least one of the bits is not set 
        x = x ^ y; 
  
        // Carry is shifted by one so that  
        // adding it to x gives the required sum 
        y = carry << 1; 
    } 
    return x; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Write code that adds two numbers using the unary operator.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
