VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write code to find the depth of a binary tree.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write code to find the depth of a binary tree.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
// Recursive function to find the maximum depth 
// of a binary tree 
int maxDepth(Node *root) 
{ 
    // Base case 
    if (root == NULL) 
        return 0; 
  
    // Recur for left subtree and right subtree 
    int lDepth = maxDepth(root->left); 
    int rDepth = maxDepth(root->right); 
  
    // Use the larger one 
    if (lDepth > rDepth) 
        return lDepth + 1; 
    else
        return rDepth + 1; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
