INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a JavaScript function that returns the first 50 prime numbers.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a JavaScript function that returns the first 50 prime numbers.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function getFirstFiftyPrimes(){
  let primes = [2];
  let num = 3;
  
  while(primes.length < 50){
      let isPrime = true;
      for(let i = 0; i < primes.length; i++){
          if(num % primes[i] === 0){
              isPrime = false;
          }
      }
      if(isPrime)
        primes.push(num);
      num += 1;
  }
  
  return primes;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Write a JavaScript function that returns the first 50 prime numbers.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
