VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: In Java, write a method that reverses an array of integers.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
In Java, write a method that reverses an array of integers.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static int[] reverseArray(int[] arr) 
{ 
    int[] reversed = new int[arr.length]; 
  
    int j = 0; 
    for (int i = arr.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        reversed[j++] = arr[i]; 
    }
  
    return reversed; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
