#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def max_element(arr): 
    max_value = arr[0][0] 
    for i in range(len(arr)): 
        for j in range(len(arr[i])): 
            if arr[i][j] > max_value: 
                max_value = arr[i][j] 
    return max_value 
  
# Driver code 
