VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Reverse a string in place

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Reverse a string in place
**Input Specification**:
```
word = ''hello''
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def reverse_string_in_place(word): 
    # Get the input string length 
    n = len(word) 

    # Swap character starting  
    # from two corners 
    for i in range(n // 2): 
        word[i], word[n - i - 1] = word[n - i - 1], word[i] 

word = list(''hello'') 
reverse_string_in_place(word) 
print(''''.join(word))
```

