INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a C++ program to output the Fibonacci Sequence up to a specified number of terms.

**Role**: Backend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a C++ program to output the Fibonacci Sequence up to a specified number of terms.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <iostream> 
  
using namespace std;
 
int fibonacci_sequence(int num_terms)  
{  
    int first = 0, second = 1, next = 0;  
  
    if (num_terms == 0)  
    {  
        return 0;  
    }  
    else if (num_terms == 1)  
    {  
        return 1;  
    }  
    else
    {  
        for (int i = 2; i <= num_terms; i++)  
        {  
            next = first + second;  
            first = second;  
            second = next;  
        }  
    }  
    return next;  
}  
  
int main()  
{  
    int num_terms;
    cout << "Enter the number of terms: ";
    cin >> num_terms;
    cout << "The requested Fibonacci sequence upto term " << num_terms << " is: ";
    for (int i = 1; i <= num_terms; i++)  
        cout << fibonacci_sequence(i) << " ";  
    return 0;  
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Backend Developer", "role_id": "backend_developer", "topic": "Backend Logic & Algorithms", "subtopic": "Create a C++ program to output the Fibonacci Sequence up to a specified number o", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
