VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: How many trailing zeros are in the factorial of the number "n"?

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
How many trailing zeros are in the factorial of the number "n"?
**Input Specification**:
```
n = 20
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
The number of trailing zeros in 20! is 4.

def trailing_zeros(n):
 count = 0
 i = 5
 while (n/i >= 1): 
  count += int(n/i) 
  i *= 5
 return count

print("The number of trailing zeros in 20! is", trailing_zeros(20))
```

