INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a JavaScript program to implement the bubble sort algorithm for sorting an array of numbers.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a JavaScript program to implement the bubble sort algorithm for sorting an array of numbers.
**Input Specification**:
```
[4, 2, 7, 1, 6, 5]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function bubbleSort(arr) {
  let temp;
  let swapped;
  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
    swapped = false;
    for (let j = 0; j < arr.length - 1; j++) {
      if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {
        temp = arr[j];
        arr[j] = arr[j + 1];
        arr[j + 1] = temp;
        swapped = true;
      }
    }
    if (!swapped) break;
  }
  return arr;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Java Developer", "role_id": "java_developer", "topic": "Java DSA & OOP Problems", "subtopic": "Write a JavaScript program to implement the bubble sort algorithm for sorting an", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
