INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function in Julia to calculate the Median of an array.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Create a function in Julia to calculate the Median of an array.
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [1, 2, 2, 3, 6, 8]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function median(arr)
  sorted_arr = sort(arr)
  n = length(sorted_arr)
  if n % 2 == 0
      return (sorted_arr[n ÷ 2] + sorted_arr[(n ÷ 2) + 1]) / 2
  else
      return sorted_arr[(n + 1) ÷ 2]
  end
end
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
