VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Using Java, create a program to find the highest value in this array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Using Java, create a program to find the highest value in this array.
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [1, 2, 4, 7, 10]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class HighestValue {
  public static int findHighest(int[] arr) { 
    int highest = arr[0]; 
    for (int i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
      highest = Math.max(highest, arr[i]); 
    }
    return highest; 
  }

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    int[] arr = {1, 2, 4, 7, 10}; 
    System.out.println(findHighest(arr)); 
  }
}
```

