INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Program a function in JavaScript to remove adjacent duplicates from the given array.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Program a function in JavaScript to remove adjacent duplicates from the given array.
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [2, 3, 3, 3, 6, 9, 9]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function removeDuplicates(arr) {
  let output = [];
  arr.forEach(function(element, index) {
    if (arr[index] != arr[index + 1]) {
      output.push(element);
    }
  }); 
  return output;
}

console.log(removeDuplicates([2, 3, 3, 3, 6, 9, 9])); 
// Output: [2, 3, 6, 9]
```

