INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write code to implement the Binary Search algorithm in Python.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write code to implement the Binary Search algorithm in Python.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def binary_search(arr, target):
    low, high = 0, len(arr) - 1

    while low <= high:
        mid = low + (high - low)//2
        if arr[mid] == target:
            return mid
        elif arr[mid] > target:
            high = mid - 1
        else:
            low = mid + 1

    return -1  # not found
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Write code to implement the Binary Search algorithm in Python.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
