INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Build a React component to toggle the display of some text.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Build a React component to toggle the display of some text.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
import React from ''react'';

class Toggle extends React.Component {
  constructor(props) {
    super(props);
    this.state = {
      visible: false
    };
  }

  handleClick = () => {
    this.setState({ visible: !this.state.visible });
  }

  render () {
    return (
      <div>
        <button onClick={this.handleClick}>Toggle</button>
        {this.state.visible && <p>Some text.</p>}
      </div>
    );
  }
}

export default Toggle;
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
