INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a python program to get all possible permutations of a given set of characters.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a python program to get all possible permutations of a given set of characters.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def get_permutations(s):
  """Get all possible permutations of a given set of characters."""
  n = len(s)
  result = []
  def recurse(i):
    if i == n:
      result.append(''''.join(s))
      return
    for j in range(i, n):
      s[i], s[j] = s[j], s[i]
      recurse(i+1) # recurse over each character
      s[i], s[j] = s[j], s[i] # backtrack
  recurse(0)
  return result
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Write a python program to get all possible permutations of a given set of charac", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
