VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write an algorithm to insert a new element in a given sorted array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write an algorithm to insert a new element in a given sorted array.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def insert(arr, num): 
    # start from the rightmost element
    i = len(arr) - 1
    while ( i >= 0 and arr[i] > num):
        arr[i+1] = arr[i]
        i -= 1
  
    arr[i+1] = num
```

