INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement quick sort on an array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement quick sort on an array.
**Input Specification**:
```
unsorted_nums = [2, 8, 1, 5, 9]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def partition(arr, low, high): 
    i = (low-1)
    pivot = arr[high]
    for j in range(low, high):
        if arr[j] < pivot:
            i = i+1
            arr[i], arr[j] = arr[j], arr[i] 
    arr[i+1], arr[high] = arr[high], arr[i+1]
    return (i+1) 

def quick_sort(arr, low, high): 
    if low < high:
        pi = partition(arr, low, high) 
        quick_sort(arr, low, pi-1) 
        quick_sort(arr, pi+1, high)

quick_sort(unsorted_nums, 0, len(unsorted_nums)-1)
print(unsorted_nums)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Implement quick sort on an array.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
