INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Given a unsorted array, sort it using the quick sort algorithm.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Given a unsorted array, sort it using the quick sort algorithm.
**Input Specification**:
```
[5, 4, 8, 7, 1, 3, 10, 9]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def quickSort(nums): 
    if len(nums) <= 1: 
        return nums
    pivot = nums[len(nums) // 2] 
    left = [x for x in nums if x < pivot]
    middle = [x for x in nums if x == pivot] 
    right = [x for x in nums if x > pivot] 
    return quickSort(left) + middle + quickSort(right)
  
   
nums = [5, 4, 8, 7, 1, 3, 10, 9] 
print(quickSort(nums))
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Given a unsorted array, sort it using the quick sort algorithm.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
