INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a JavaScript program to group an array of objects based on a property and sum up the values of the grouped objects.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a JavaScript program to group an array of objects based on a property and sum up the values of the grouped objects.
**Input Specification**:
```
arr = [
   {name: ''John'', salary: 100},
   {name: ''Heather'', salary: 200},
   {name: ''John'', salary: 300},
   {name: ''Heather'', salary: 400}
]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
let groupedArray = arr.reduce((acc, cur) => {
  let result = acc.find(item => item.name === cur.name);
  if (!result) {
    result = {name: cur.name, salary: 0};
    acc.push(result);
  }
  result.salary += cur.salary;
  return acc;
}, []);

console.log(groupedArray);
```

