VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Design a text-based game in C++ in which the player can move around the game world.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Design a text-based game in C++ in which the player can move around the game world.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <iostream>
#include <string>

std::string room_name;
int player_position_x = 0;
int player_position_y = 0;

void move_player(int x, int y) {
    player_position_x += x;
    player_position_y += y;
    room_name = get_room_name(player_position_x, player_position_y);
    std::cout << "Moved to " << room_name << std::endl;
}

std::string get_room_name(int x, int y) {
    std::string name;
    // implement function to return the name of the room at given coordinates
 
    return name;
}

