INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a sorting algorithm to quickly sort an array of integers

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a sorting algorithm to quickly sort an array of integers
**Input Specification**:
```
Array: [5, 4, 6, 7, 1]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
function quickSort(arr) {
  if (arr.length <= 1) { 
    return arr;
  }
  let pivot = arr.pop();
  let left = [];
  let right = [];

  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
    if (arr[i] < pivot) {
      left.push(arr[i]);
    } else {
      right.push(arr[i]);
    }
  }
  return quickSort(left).concat([pivot], quickSort(right));
}

console.log(quickSort([5, 4, 6, 7, 1])); // [1, 4, 5, 6, 7]
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Create a sorting algorithm to quickly sort an array of integers", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
