INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement a recursive solution to calculate the nth Fibonacci number.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement a recursive solution to calculate the nth Fibonacci number.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def fibonacci(n): 
    if n<0: 
        print("Incorrect input") 
    elif n==1: 
        return 0
    elif n==2: 
        return 1
    else: 
        return fibonacci(n-1)+fibonacci(n-2)
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Implement a recursive solution to calculate the nth Fibonacci number.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
