INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Using Java, write a function that takes an input string and returns the string reversed.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Using Java, write a function that takes an input string and returns the string reversed.
**Input Specification**:
```
String input = "Hello World!";
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static String reverseString(String input) { 
    StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder(); 
    for (int i = input.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--) { 
        sb.append(input.charAt(i)); 
    } 
    return sb.toString(); 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
