#### Problem Description
Make a regex pattern that returns the name and the day of the week given in the paragraph.
**Input Specification**:
```
text = "My name is John, and today is Monday"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
import re

text = "My name is John, and today is Monday"

pattern = r"My name is (\w+), and today is (\w+)"

match = re.search(pattern, text)
name = match.group(1)
day = match.group(2)

print(name) # Output: John
print(day) # Output: Monday
```

