INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Compute the number of ways to make a change of N with coins of given denominations.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Compute the number of ways to make a change of N with coins of given denominations.
**Input Specification**:
```
N = 4; Coins = {1,2,3}
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def change(n, coins): 
    m = len(coins) 
    table = [[0 for x in range(m)] for x in range(n+1)] 

    # Fill the entries for 0 value case (n = 0) 
    for i in range(m): 
        table[0][i] = 1

    # Fill rest of the table entries in bottom-up manner 
    for i in range(1, n+1): 
        for j in range(m): 
            # Count of solutions including coins[j] 
            x = table[i - coins[j]][j] if i-coins[j] >= 0 else 0

            # Count of solutions excluding coins[j] 
            y = table[i][j-1] if j >= 1 else 0 

            # total count 
            table[i][j] = x + y 
    return table[n][m-1]
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Compute the number of ways to make a change of N with coins of given denominatio", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
