VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a program in Java to check whether the given word is a palindrome or not.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a program in Java to check whether the given word is a palindrome or not.
**Input Specification**:
```
"radar"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class Palindrome{ 
    public static boolean checkPalindrome(String str){ 
        int i=0,j=str.length()-1; 
        while(i<j){ 
            if(str.charAt(i) != str.charAt(j)) 
                return false; 
            i++;j--; 
        } 
        return true; 
    } 
}
```

