```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public ListNode reverseKGroup(ListNode head, int k) {
    ListNode curr = head;
    ListNode prev = null;
    
    int count = 0;
    
    while (curr != null && count != k) {
        ListNode next = curr.next;
        curr.next = prev;
        prev = curr;
        curr = next;
        count++;
    }
    
    if (next != null) {
        head.next = reverseKGroup(next, k);
    }
    
    return prev;
}
```

