VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Using C++, write a program to sort an array of strings alphabetically.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Using C++, write a program to sort an array of strings alphabetically.
**Input Specification**:
```
["Hello", "World", "This", "Is", "A", "Test"]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include<iostream>
#include<algorithm>
using namespace std;
  
int main() 
{ 
    string arr[] = { "Hello", "World", "This", "Is", "A", "Test" }; 
    int n = sizeof(arr) / sizeof(arr[0]); 
  
    sort(arr, arr + n); 
  
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) 
        cout << arr[i] << " "; 
  
    return 0; 
}
```

