INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a code to decode a given URL encoded string.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a code to decode a given URL encoded string.
**Input Specification**:
```
%40%7C%2523%5B
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def decode_url(string):
    string = string.replace(''%40'', ''@'')
    string = string.replace(''%7C'', ''|'')
    string = string.replace(''%2523'', ''#'')
    string = string.replace(''%5B'', ''['')
    return string
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
