INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function that given two strings, returns a new string with the characters of the two strings alternating.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a function that given two strings, returns a new string with the characters of the two strings alternating.
**Input Specification**:
```
(''abcd'', ''efgh'')
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def alternating_strings(str1, str2):
    result = ""
    
    for i in range(min(len(str1), len(str2))):
        result += str1[i] + str2[i]
    
    # take care of the rest of the elements
    if len(str1) > len(str2):
        result += str1[len(str1)-1]
    else:
        result += str2[len(str2)-1]
    
    return result
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a function that given two strings, returns a new string with the characte", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
