INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function that takes in an array of strings as input and returns the longest string in the array.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Write a function that takes in an array of strings as input and returns the longest string in the array.
**Input Specification**:
```
["Apple", "Banana", "Orange"]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
string longestString(string[] strArr) {
    string longest = "";
    for (string str : strArr) {
        if (str.length() > longest.length()) {
            longest = str;
        }
    }
    return longest;
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Write a function that takes in an array of strings as input and returns the long", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Easy", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
