```
string1 = "aa"
string2 = "aaaaaa"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def pattern_occurences(string1, string2):
    positions = []
    for i in range(len(string2)):
        if string1 == string2[i:i+len(string1)]:
