INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function that encodes a message into a Vigenere cipher

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Create a function that encodes a message into a Vigenere cipher

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def vigenere_encode(message, key):
    encoded_message = ""
    key_index = 0
    for character in message:
        if character.isalpha():
            shift_amount = ord(key[key_index]) % 26
            key_index += 1
            if key_index == len(key):
                key_index = 0  
            shifted_char_code = ord(character) + shift_amount
            if shifted_char_code > ord(''z''):
                shifted_char_code -= 26
            encoded_message += chr(shifted_char_code)
        else:
            encoded_message += character
    return encoded_message
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Create a function that encodes a message into a Vigenere cipher", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
