INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Sort an array in C using selection sort.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Sort an array in C using selection sort.
**Input Specification**:
```
int nums[] = {5, 2, -3, 10, 23, 99, -1, 7, 93, 0};
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
int nums[] = {-3, -1, 0, 2, 5, 7, 10, 23, 93, 99};

void selection_sort(int nums[], int n) {
    int i, j, min_idx; 
  
    // One by one move boundary of unsorted sub-array 
    for (i = 0; i < n-1; i++) {
        // Find the minimum element in unsorted array 
        min_idx = i; 
        for (j = i+1; j < n; j++) {
            if (nums[j] < nums[min_idx]) 
            min_idx = j; 
        }
  
        // Swap the found minimum element with the first element 
        swap(&nums[min_idx], &nums[i]); 
    } 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Sort an array in C using selection sort.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
