INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a java program to print the frequencies of all characters in a string.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a java program to print the frequencies of all characters in a string.
**Input Specification**:
```
string = "mississippi"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public class Frequency { 
	static void characterFrequency(String str) 
	{ 
		// size of the string ''str'' 
		int n = str.length(); 

		// ''freq[]'' implemented as hash table 
		int freq[] = new int[256]; 

		// accumulate freqeuncy of each character 
		// in ''str'' 
		for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) 
			freq[str.charAt(i)]++; 

		// traverse ''str'' from left to right 
		for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { 

			// if frequency of character str.charAt(i) 
			// is not equal to 0 
			if (freq[str.charAt(i)] != 0) { 

				// print the character along with its 
				// frequency 
				System.out.print(str.charAt(i)); 
				System.out.print(freq[str.charAt(i)] + " "); 

				// update frequency of str.charAt(i) to 
				// 0 so that the same character is not printed 
				// again 
				freq[str.charAt(i)] = 0; 
			} 
		} 
	} 

	// Driver code 
	public static void main(String args[]) 
	{ 
		String str = "mississippi"; 
		characterFrequency(str); 
	} 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Write a java program to print the frequencies of all characters in a string.", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
