VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a function in Java that sorts a given array of integers.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a function in Java that sorts a given array of integers.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static int[] sortArray(int[] arr) { 
    int n = arr.length; 
  
    for (int i = 0; i < n-1; i++) 
        for (int j = 0; j < n-i-1; j++) 
            if (arr[j] > arr[j+1]) 
            { 
                // swap arr[j+1] and arr[i] 
                int temp = arr[j]; 
                arr[j] = arr[j+1]; 
                arr[j+1] = temp; 
            } 
    return arr; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
