VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Develop a C program to compute the factorial of a given number n.

**Role**: Data Analyst | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Easy

#### Problem Description
Develop a C program to compute the factorial of a given number n.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include <stdio.h>
 
int factorial(int n)
{
    int res = 1, i;
    
    for (i = 2; i <= n; i++)
        res *= i;
    return res;
}

int main()
{
    int n;    
    
    scanf("%d", &n);
    printf("%d", factorial(n));
        
    return 0;
}
```

