INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Implement an algorithm to sort the following array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Implement an algorithm to sort the following array.
**Input Specification**:
```
[3, 5, 4, 6, 1, 2]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def sortArray(array):
    n = len(array)
    for i in range(n):
        min_index = i
        for j in range(i+1, n):
            if array[min_index] > array[j]:
                min_index = j
        array[i], array[min_index] = array[min_index], array[i]
    return array
```

