INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a function that takes a sentence as a string and returns a string containing the sentence in reverse order.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a function that takes a sentence as a string and returns a string containing the sentence in reverse order.
**Input Specification**:
```
"I am learning to code"
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public String reverse(String sentence) {
    StringBuilder reversedSentence = new StringBuilder();
    
    String[] words = sentence.split(" ");
    
    for (int i = words.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        reversedSentence.append(words[i]);
        reversedSentence.append(" ");
    }
    
    return reversedSentence.toString().trim();
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Create a function that takes a sentence as a string and returns a string contain", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Medium", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
