INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a C++ program to find the kth smallest element in an unsorted array using minimum number of comparisons.

**Role**: Frontend Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Write a C++ program to find the kth smallest element in an unsorted array using minimum number of comparisons.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
#include<algorithm>
#include<math.h>

using namespace std;

int kthSmallest(int arr[], int n, int k) 
{ 
    sort(arr, arr + n); 
  
    return arr[k - 1]; 
} 

// Function to find the kth smallest element 
int kthSmallestWComp(int arr[], int n, int k) 
{ 
    // Initialize values of left and right 
    int left = -2147483648, right = 2147483647, ans = -1; 
    while (left <= right) 
    { 
        int mid = (left + right) / 2; 
        int countLtEqMid = 0, countGtMid = 0; 
  
        // Loop to count total less than equal mid 
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) 
            if (arr[i] <= mid) 
                countLtEqMid++; 
        // Loop to count total greater than mid 
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) 
            if (arr[i] > mid) 
                countGtMid++; 
  
        if (countLtEqMid < k && k <= (countLtEqMid + countGtMid)) 
        { 
            ans = mid; 
            left = mid + 1; 
        } 
        else if (countLtEqMid >= k) 
            right = mid - 1; 
  
        else
            left = mid + 1; 
    } 
    return ans; 
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Frontend Developer", "role_id": "frontend_developer", "topic": "JavaScript / DOM / React Tasks", "subtopic": "Write a C++ program to find the kth smallest element in an unsorted array using ", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
