INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a C# program to remove the leading and trailing spaces in a given string.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a C# program to remove the leading and trailing spaces in a given string.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static string RemoveLeadingAndTrailingSpaces(string str)  
{  
    // To remove leading spaces  
    while (str.StartsWith(" "))  
    {  
        str = str.Substring(1);  
    }  
   
    // To remove trailing spaces  
    while (str.EndsWith(" "))  
    {  
        str = str.Substring(0, str.Length - 1);  
    }  
   
    return str;  
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
