VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Write a C# program to remove all occurrences of an item from an array.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Write a C# program to remove all occurrences of an item from an array.
**Input Specification**:
```
[1,2,3,4,5,2,3,4]
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static void RemoveOccurrence(int[] array, int item)
{
    //Declare a new variable to store new list of items
    List<int> result = new List<int>();
	
    for (int i = 0; i < array.Length; i++)
    {
        if (array[i] != item)
        {
            result.Add(array[i]);
        }
    }
	
    //Print remaining items
    Console.WriteLine("After removing, remaining elements are:");
    foreach (int num in result)
    {
        Console.Write(num + " ");
    }
}
```

