INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Create a method to validate an email address in Java.

**Role**: Java Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Medium

#### Problem Description
Create a method to validate an email address in Java.

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
public static boolean isValidEmail(String str) {
    String emailRegex = "^[a-zA-Z0-9_+&*-]+(?:\\."+
                        "[a-zA-Z0-9_+&*-]+)*@" +
                        "(?:[a-zA-Z0-9-]+\\.)+[a-z" +
                        "A-Z]{2,7}$";
    Pattern pat = Pattern.compile(emailRegex);
    if (str == null)
        return false;
    return pat.matcher(str).matches();
}
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
