#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
```
import re

s = ''John Smith, 33''

firstName = re.match("^\w+", s).group(0)
lastName = re.search("\w+$", s).group(0)
age = re.findall("(\d+)", s)[0]

print(firstName, lastName, age)

```
