INSERT INTO public.document_embeddings (content, metadata)
VALUES ('### Real Coding Task: Using the given information, write a function to calculate a 5-digit ISBN number.

**Role**: Python Developer | **Category**: Coding | **Difficulty**: Hard

#### Problem Description
Using the given information, write a function to calculate a 5-digit ISBN number.
**Input Specification**:
```
Author name: Bob Smith
Title of Book: Learn Programming
Publisher: Aztec Publishing
Year Published: 2020
```

#### Verified Solution & Code Implementation
```text
def calculate_isbn(authorname, title, publisher, yearpublished):
    authorname_string = authorname.replace('' '', '''')
    title_string = title.replace('' '', '''')
    publisher_string = publisher.replace('' '', '''')

    isbn_total = 0

    for letter in authorname_string:
        isbn_total += ord(letter)

    for letter in title_string:
        isbn_total += ord(letter)

    for letter in publisher_string:
        isbn_total += ord(letter) 

    isbn_total += yearpublished

    while isbn_total > 9999:
        isbn_total = isbn_total % 10000

    isbn_string = str(isbn_total).zfill(5)

    return isbn_string
```

#### Complexity & Quality Rubric
- **Validation**: Handles nominal and boundary test cases.
- **Best Practice**: Adheres to idiomatic design and standard time/space constraints.', '{"role": "Python Developer", "role_id": "python_developer", "topic": "Python Algorithms & Data Structures", "subtopic": "Using the given information, write a function to calculate a 5-digit ISBN number", "category": "Coding", "difficulty": "Hard", "source": "https://github.com/sahil280114/codealpaca", "dataset_type": "Real-World-CodeAlpaca-20k"}'::jsonb)
